s engine: speed-based movement, smooth GPS interpolation, road snapping, anomaly detection\n- Admin dashboard: Recorded Students panel with per-route breakdown\n- Student dashboard: Notifications panel polling /api/notifications\n- Database: seeded all 54 vehicles (was only 10)\n- Fixed anomaly detection rejecting simulated GPS (skip when previous fix >2min old)\n- Fixed database read-only permissions\n- LiveTrackingPage: full-width layout (removed max-width constraints)\n- All buttons tested and verified working","tree":{"sha":"ce0973ba7c748f490420855d4645100dd15fa443","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dareshg06-tech/ritians-transport/git/trees/ce0973ba7c748f490420855d4645100dd15fa443"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dareshg06-tech/ritians-transport/git/commits/a416beb9ea15042565012dd821b0c697af20059d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/dareshg06-tech/ritians-transport/commit/a416beb9ea15042565012dd821b0c697af20059d","node_id":"C_kwDOUXr3CdoAKGE0MTZiZWI5ZWExNTA0MjU2NTAxMmRkODIxYjBjNjk3YWYyMDA1OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dareshg06-tech/ritians-transport/commit/f77c8b17670be5d65f2b113ddee4399739911f55","sha":"f77c8b17670be5d65f2b113ddee4399739911f55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dareshg06-tech/ritians-transport/commits/f77c8b17670be5d65f2b113ddee4399739911f55"}],"sha":"a416beb9ea15042565012dd821b0c697af20059d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dareshg06-tech/ritians-transport/commits/a416beb9ea15042565012dd821b0c697af20059d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dareshg06-tech/ritians-transport/commits/f77c8b17670be5d65f2b113ddee4399739911f55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T09:02:37Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T09:02:37Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"099f465f-8899-422b-b430-fc50aae28b90","tree"