ici 8, which requires Node >=22.19 and breaks the Node 20 matrix with webidl.util.markAsUncloneable.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"483c818f8496ed7aa68949ce3b161087cd54e4d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senthilkumar979/useThisHook/git/trees/483c818f8496ed7aa68949ce3b161087cd54e4d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senthilkumar979/useThisHook/git/commits/baf1d196785b9a43cf8e4448d12d2ed912fb66a4","verification":{"payload":"tree 483c818f8496ed7aa68949ce3b161087cd54e4d5\nparent b07302c069d36865de267c210c6575a0a45b0e3f\nauthor Senthil Kumar Thangavel <37953260+senthilkumar979@users.noreply.github.com> 1790616401 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790616401 +0200\n\nImprove docs, SEO, and wiki sync (#34)\n\n* Improve docs, SEO, and wiki sync\n\nThis change updates the documentation to the path-based playground URLs, adds generated SEO assets and route-aware metadata for the docs site, and introduces a GitHub wiki sync workflow with in-repo wiki sources. It also tightens the React peer install versions in CI and refreshes package metadata for discoverability.\n\n* Pin jsdom to 29.x for Node 20 CI compatibility.\n\njsdom 30 pulls undici 8, which requires Node >=22.19 and breaks the Node 20 matrix with webidl.util.markAsUncloneable.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquqNRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPa4QAH0e/pTfdlmR5C/kmEGplxDV\nbbkf9r06BmexFV82f2F7Es+MZuYm3hD/r48fDAUtORIT06tS+MFhhxfBlAIwM24V\nbVMEcE+V8XJaAcqNFS10a1DzXzxBprAzhN1kKkdmBsmxRmUa9OgirbGC0QpNR8x7\n7BxOOKuLIu+mhSJTxh13e2kh+Z5xKkIQiw0rnpaylLeNrk9BoIjSm5FMYTSMoaec\nz20LNgKEW43Nx+OV83fFxOptpAZAq3/7HyCf5rO/t977OUYClBmYWJ49ev8JjvgL\nsDySE1iWiBKYCsfAH11F8R0enq81oq/5Tor7nIp3E0WLHv2+fJ1tLDWVlhl6Bx1O\nqoykEYtYBB/Pc+b+pR4AnFwplS8H815hnymIfC/MM/eukc174hSzxm/Y5A4