//api.github.com/users/Adarshh-subrahmannyan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adarshh-subrahmannyan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adarshh-subrahmannyan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adarshh-subrahmannyan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Adarshh-subrahmannyan/devdays/commits/e6a8374eda04681730a4884d661a5a3bc2ea0012/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:44:20Z","email":"adarshh005@gmail.com","name":"AdarshSubrahmannyan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:44:20Z","email":"adarshh005@gmail.com","name":"AdarshSubrahmannyan"},"message":"feat: build care_inventory plugin for stock management\n\n- Create Django backend plugin with InventoryItem model\n  * Fields: name, sku (unique), category, quantity, reorder_level, unit\n  * Timestamps: created_at, updated_at\n  * Property: is_low_stock (quantity <= reorder_level)\n  * Validator: non-negative quantity\n\n- Implement REST API viewset with full CRUD + custom actions\n  * Endpoints: GET/POST /items, GET/PUT/DELETE /items/{id}\n  * Custom action: POST /items/{id}/adjust-stock/ for stock adjustments\n  * Filtering: category parameter support\n\n- Build React frontend dashboard with inventory overview\n  * Stock overview cards: total units, low-stock items, coverage %\n  * Responsive data table with SKU, quantity, reorder level, status badges\n  * Color-coded indicators (green/healthy, amber/low-stock)\n  * Navigation integration: added to all menu levels\n\n- Add comprehensive test suite\n  * test_low_stock_flag_activates_when_quantity_is_at_reorder_level\n  * test_inventory_item_keeps_a_unique_sku\n  * Both tests passing ✓\n\n- Build validation\n  * Backend unit tests: PASS\n  * Frontend production build: PASS (1760 modules, 16 assets)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d7817d34b15a0