ps://api.github.com/users/ccastrotrejo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccastrotrejo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ccastrotrejo/BioToolWebsite/commits/77b2e34528d4ce3bfb61992a6fc8cadd5a81a35e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:31:41Z","email":"carlos_castro5156@outlook.es","name":"Carlos Castro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:31:41Z","email":"carlos_castro5156@outlook.es","name":"Carlos Castro"},"message":"feat: add Vue 3 device-library module alongside the React shell\n\nRestructure into an npm-workspaces monorepo (apps/shell,\napps/structure-library, packages/core|contracts|theme). The structure\ndiscovery / device library is now a real Vue 3 module mounted into the\nReact shell through a versioned, framework-neutral mount/update/unmount\ncontract, with metadata-only cross-framework state and explicit React\nrecovery if the lazy Vue chunk fails to load. All science, exports and\ntheme are shared packages. 211 unit tests + 14 Playwright workflows pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"563cdd804ec1056137b96ff33b561e6fdf83f77d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ccastrotrejo/BioToolWebsite/git/trees/563cdd804ec1056137b96ff33b561e6fdf83f77d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ccastrotrejo/BioToolWebsite/git/commits/77b2e34528d4ce3bfb61992a6fc8cadd5a81a35e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102700317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccastrotrejo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccastrotrejo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccastrotrejo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccastrotrejo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ccastrotrejo"