/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/a8ff769db653e1ed3be6744d92c6079794b7067f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:42:22Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:42:22Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"message":"Privacy policy: describe the optional Chapter 1-3 document upload\n\nNew \"Optional Chapter 1-3 Document\" subsection in section 3, and a pointer\nin section 1''s list. States what the code does: the .docx is read and\ndiscarded (file and name not kept); only the found objectives, their\nheading, a SHA-256 fingerprint and the check date are saved, with emails\nand phone numbers masked, and nothing if no clear list is found; the rest\nof the document (title page, declaration, acknowledgements, abstract) is\nnot kept; it is not sent to any AI provider; \"Use this wording\" copies\nwording into Research Context, where it is treated like typed objectives\n(including as AI background context for open-ended analysis); Remove,\nproject deletion or account deletion deletes it. Last updated -> 30 Sep.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb40fd546aac5af1229c1725a4a77a313b970c31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/trees/bb40fd546aac5af1229c1725a4a77a313b970c31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/commits/a8ff769db653e1ed3be6744d92c6079794b7067f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist