" and a variable\noverride (\"Use these variables\") all set the one screen-wide `loading`\nflag, and every button on the step read it -- so saving the qualitative\nselection showed \"Analysing...\" on Run analysis, running analysis showed\n\"Saving...\" on Update selection, and an override save showed both.\n\nEach action now has its own busy flag (useThesisWorkflow busyActions,\nactionBusy.js). A button shows its loading label only for its own action;\nwhile any action runs, the others are disabled with their normal label so\nrequests can''t overlap (e.g. running analysis on a selection still being\nsaved). The screen-wide flag stays for whole-screen work (opening a\nproject, uploads, validate/activate, download).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d435b6ec80a976fe11e91ff38fe4896b24504c72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/trees/d435b6ec80a976fe11e91ff38fe4896b24504c72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/commits/ad1e0641ba8807f3715295a2946bda872d3f0692","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commit/ad1e0641ba8807f3715295a2946bda872d3f0692","node_id":"C_kwDOUYV0zNoAKGFkMWUwNjQxYmE4ODA3ZjM3MTUyOTVhMjk0NmJkYTg3MmQzZjA2OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commit/5d79c4d777388dffacde0de3c0889acd1ca14931","sha":"5d79c4d777388dffacde0de3c0889acd1ca14931","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/5d79c4d777388dffacde0de3c0889acd1ca14931"}],"sha":"ad1e0641ba8807f3715295a2946bda872d3f0692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/ad1e0641ba8807f3715295a2946bda872d3f0692"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/039f2d9579892afa9ee4947c37d64801fac0a02b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:44:56Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:44:56Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"message":"Give each Analysis-step action its own loading state\n\n\"Update selection\", \"Run analysis\", \"Understand dataset\" and a variable\noverride (\"Use these variables\") all set the one screen-wide `loading`\nflag, and every button on the step read it -- so saving the qualitative\nselection showed \"Analysing...\" on Run analysis, running analysis showed\n\"Saving...\" on Update selection, and an override save showed both.\n\nEach action now has its own busy flag (useThesisWorkflow busyActions,\nactionBusy.js). A button shows its loading label only for its own action;\nwhile any action runs, the others are disabled with their normal label so\nrequests can''t overlap (e.g. running analysis on a selection still being\nsaved). The screen-wide flag stays for whole-screen work (opening a\nproject, uploads, validate/activate, download).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"05bfda98e7c43cc961c2f61848f78c534e74ec29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/trees/05bfda98e7c43cc961c2f61848f78c534e74ec29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/commits/039f2d9579892afa9ee4947c37d64801fac0a02b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_u