},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:32:52Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"message":"Show each entered objective beside the document objective it matches\n\nThe comparison is now a two-column table with one row per document\nobjective, in document order. A matched entered objective renders in the\nsame row as its match; a document row with no match shows an empty cell;\nentered objectives without a match (and a second copy of wording already\nplaced) follow, in their original order. Every objective keeps its real\nnumber in its own list. Display order only: Research Context''s objectives\nand their order are unchanged. On phones each row stacks, with a side\nlabel per cell.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5de355fe4dc5d90e6a8ae4021818c57698c8cb6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/trees/5de355fe4dc5d90e6a8ae4021818c57698c8cb6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/commits/71c65532e7b254fbb0d318eef0bbbdbbcfbb9b75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commit/71c65532e7b254fbb0d318eef0bbbdbbcfbb9b75","node_id":"C_kwDOUYV0zNoAKDcxYzY1NTMyZTdiMjU0ZmJiMGQzMThlZWYwYmJiZGJiY2ZiYjliNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commit/b25d5e418e83fd75afbb096a9226534380460a6f","sha":"b25d5e418e83fd75afbb096a9226534380460a6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/b25d5e418e83fd75afbb096a9226534380460a6f"}],"sha":"71c65532e7b254fbb0d318eef0bbbdbbcfbb9b75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/71c65532e7b254fbb0d318eef0bbbdbbcfbb9b75"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/b25d5e418e83fd75afbb096a9226534380460a6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:29:25Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:29:25Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"message":"Add \"Use this wording\" to unmatched document objectives\n\nOn the document side of the Chapter 1 comparison, each unmatched line gets\na \"Use this wording ->\" button. It copies the document''s wording into\nResearch Context''s objectives: replacing the entered objective at the same\nnumber, or adding it at the end if the entered list is shorter. Saved with\nthe same project PATCH Research Context uses, without saveSetup''s step\nchange or screen-wide loading; the panel re-checks matches from the saved\nproject immediately. Matched lines and the \"You entered\" side get nothing;\nnothing flows from Adanse into the document.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c2be5b8c1d64bf6032d72e42f187712d032758f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/trees/c2be5b8c1d64bf6032d72e42f187712d032758f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/commits/b25d5e418e83fd75afbb096a9226534380460a6f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commit/b25d5e418e83fd75afbb096a9226534380460a6f","node_id":"C_kwDOUYV0zNoAKGIyNWQ1ZTQxOGU4M2ZkNzVhZmJiMDk2YTkyMjY1MzQzODA0NjBhNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commit/9837213d011c01a51dcc991943cc9d0252187192","sha":"9837213d011c01a51dcc991943cc9d0252187192","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/9837213d011c01a51dcc991943cc9d0252187192"}],"sha":"b25d5e418e83fd75afbb096a9226534380460a6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/b25d5e418e83fd75afbb096a9226534380460a6f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/9837213d011c01a51dcc991943cc9d0252187192/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:26:27Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:26:27Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"message":"Name the matching item''s position on matched Chapter 1 lines\n\nA matched line now says which numbered item it matches on the other side:\n\"Matches item 2 in what you entered\" (document side) and \"Matches item 3\nin your document\" (entered side), using each list''s own 1-based numbering.\nIf the same wording appears twice on the other side, the first is named.\nUnmatched lines keep \"No exact match found\". Matching (normalized exact\nequality), text and order are unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c71f712cb7f5c7396ee1aa6bc8776431d9a1124","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/trees/0c71f712cb7f5c7396ee1aa6bc8776431d9a1124"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/commits/9837213d011c01a51dcc991943cc9d0252187192","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commit/9837213d011c01a51dcc991943cc9d0252187192","node_id":"C_kwDOUYV0zNoAKDk4MzcyMTNkMDExYzAxYTUxZGNjOTkxOTQzY2M5ZDAyNTIxODcxOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.co