_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/71c7135a8de1a72a689c6491cd0f60ef4d033a9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:05:54Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:05:54Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"message":"Stay on the Dataset step after uploading; move on with Continue\n\nUploading a dataset jumped straight to Dataset Review, so the optional\nChapter 1-3 panel (only on the Dataset step) disappeared before the\nresearcher could attach their document, whichever they uploaded first.\nThe Word result itself was kept (saved on the project) but not visible.\n\n- file() uploads and stays on the Dataset step (a project created by the\n  upload gets its /dataset URL).\n- Continue decides: Dataset Review when a cleaned version is waiting to be\n  reviewed (never skipped), analysis when the dataset is already active;\n  if neither is known it asks the server (legacy projects -> analysis).\n  Previously Continue always went to analysis.\n- The Chapter 1 panel stays visible while a dataset uploads, locked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb70a5db599400f7848416604bb9a1ffc5bb95c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/trees/cb70a5db599400f784