followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/0a7716c6a456815aeccb66c67bf572d489d8285d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T21:15:31Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T21:15:31Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"message":"Optional: show your Chapter 1 objectives next to the ones you entered\n\nOn the Dataset step, a researcher can upload their Chapter 1-3 Word document\n(.docx). The objectives Adanse finds in Chapter 1 (word for word, or none)\nare shown side by side with the objectives saved in Research Context.\nInformational only: nothing changes Research Context or Chapter 4, and the\nwording passes no judgement.\n\n- .docx only, checked before upload; the backend''s refusal is shown as-is.\n- One-line consent notice: the document is used only for this comparison\n  and isn''t stored.\n- When nothing clear is found, nothing from the document is shown.\n- Errors stay next to the panel, not in the screen-wide banner.\n\nNeeds backend PR #70 (and its migration).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e545ef027d5b4f8c3546ac2b67f10e747fff91dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-fron