DhkZmZhY2RlMGRlM2MwODg5YWNkMWNhMTQ5MzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commit/3cb4ca2d41a434175a0194dee85743e1e058347f","sha":"3cb4ca2d41a434175a0194dee85743e1e058347f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/3cb4ca2d41a434175a0194dee85743e1e058347f"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commit/6321d6edcf396112da4c89409fa6c6fe280f2720","sha":"6321d6edcf396112da4c89409fa6c6fe280f2720","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/6321d6edcf396112da4c89409fa6c6fe280f2720"}],"sha":"5d79c4d777388dffacde0de3c0889acd1ca14931","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/5d79c4d777388dffacde0de3c0889acd1ca14931"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/6321d6edcf396112da4c89409fa6c6fe280f2720/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T19:54:24Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T19:54:24Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"message":"Add \"Continue with Google\" to the sign-in and sign-up screens\n\nGoogle sign-in is enabled in the dev Supabase project. The auth screen now\noffers it under the email/password form, after an \"or\" divider, on both\nsign-in and sign-up (on sign-up the Terms/Privacy line sits above both ways\nof creating an account). Not on the code-entry or forgot-password screens.\n\n- AuthContext.signInWithGoogle: supabase.auth.signInWithOAuth({ provider:\n  \"google\" }) redirecting back to the site root, built like the\n  password-reset link (VITE_SITE_URL, else the page''s own origin, so\n  previews and local dev come back to themselves). The existing\n  onAuthStateChange picks up the session.\n- If the person cancels on Google''s screen (or the provider errors),\n  Supabase comes back with the error in the URL: the sign-in screen now\n  shows it once and removes it from the address bar.\n- The Supabase client keeps its default (implicit) flow. PKCE is\n  client-wide and would tie every password-reset link to the browser that\n  requested it; decided to keep resets working across devices.\n\nChecked in a real browser against a mock of Supabase''s side of the round\ntrip (Google itself can''t run headless): 10 checks -- button placement on\nsign-in and sign-up and not on forgot-password, phone width, the authorize\nrequest (provider=google, redirect back to the site root, implicit flow),\na completed round trip landing signed in with the tokens cleared from the\nURL, and a cancelled one showing the message with the URL cleaned.\noauth.test.js covers the redirect URL, the error parsing and the wiring;\n290 unit tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0742e287ec374843289a1ab99deaa98b13a164a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/trees/e0742e287ec374843289a1ab99deaa98b13a164a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/commits/6321d6edcf396112da4c89409fa6c6fe2