sis-action-bar: text on top, the\naction full width under it. A credit-priced action (.credit-action, e.g.\nRun analysis) stretches too, with its cost note under the button, left\naligned. The review screen''s dataset-review-actions class is gone.\n\nreviewLayout.test.js''s rule finder could run past the end of an earlier\n@media block and match a top-level rule; it now matches braces and looks\ninside each block only.\n\nChecked in a real browser at 390px: all nine analysis and qualitative\nfooters stack (text and button at full width, headings on one line where\nthey took two), with screenshots; #67''s review-screen checks still pass\n9/9. 273 unit tests pass; the new layout tests fail 2/6 on develop''s CSS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a8f510c28fbd7b005c438f9259c2319aeed4c27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/trees/9a8f510c28fbd7b005c438f9259c2319aeed4c27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/commits/2eff00eba704530b0ea83253ecd43b25ce217000","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subs