 opening one\n\nselect() waited for getConversation and listMessages to finish before\nstarting getThesisProject, even though that call only needs the id it\nalready had. On a reload or deep link this put the project request after\nthe other two instead of beside them, adding one full round trip to the\ntime the page stays blank.\n\nAll three now run in one Promise.all. The project request''s expected 404\n(no project row yet) resolves to a sentinel inside the group, so the\ncreate fallback still runs afterwards with the conversation''s title. Any\nother error still rejects and reaches runAction''s error banner, as before.\n\nChecked against a mock backend with 300ms per call: on develop the\nproject request starts ~315ms after the other two; with this change all\nthree start within 3ms. Existing project, 404 -> create -> setup, and a\n500 -> error banner all behave as before. 252 unit tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d57e17dc9f492f3d2e5a18fb61b112c1bd60f0ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/trees/d57e17dc9f492f3d2e5a18fb61b112c1bd60f0ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/commits/0a5311d6548e3aae5619d8f0d075cae1271f54eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https:/