b.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/e3b6b91425ca6d736c1d59346c2a58db430a0267/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:07:46Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:07:46Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"message":"Project routes, PR 4/4: chapter4 and its gate\n\nLast of four PRs building Stage 2. Confirmed based on develop''s current tip\n(c390a4d, which already has PR 1-3 merged) before starting, not on any\nnow-stale stacked branch.\n\nChapter4 joins the other four steps as a real route -- /project/:id/chapter4\n-- with its gate (chapter4Gate) applied by select() exactly as goToChapter4()\nhas always applied it: not while a qualitative finalize is running or a\nsource is unfinalized, and not while results are out of date. A blocked\nrequest is corrected to /analysis (or, per PR 1''s fix, all the way to\n/dataset if analysis isn''t reachable either -- reachable live for the first\ntime now that chapter4 has a URL at all) and shown the gate''s OWN message\n(which source, or that results are stale), not a generic notice. The gate is\nevaluated against the freshly-loaded project on every reload/deep-link, not\na stale local copy.\n\ngoToChapter4/backToAnalysis now push/history-navigate like every other step\ntransition in this stage. No App.jsx changes were needed: its render guard\n(isChapter4 && analysis &&) already satisfied \"render nothing until the\nanalysis has loaded\" as a side effect of select() always loading the project\nbefore deciding the route.\n\nSince all five PROJECT_STEPS are now routed, the local ROUTED_STEPS set\n(which had grown to equal PROJECT_STEPS exactly) is removed in favour of the\nexisting isProjectStep() check -- the stage''s own natural conclusion, not\nscope creep.\n\nChecked in a real browser (mock backend, headless Edge): 14 checks, including\nthe gate open/blocked/nothing-built cases live via deep link, reload staying\nput, the live Continue-to-Chapter4 -> history-aware Back -> browser\nForward/Back round trip, the header link''s disabled state, and a download\nupdating the credit balance from the real response header. The same harness\nfails 3 of its checks on the pre-PR4 code (proven after fixing a race in the\nharness itself: the browser''s URL bar shows the requested path immediately on\nnavigation, before select()''s async gate check has run, so \"stays on\nchapter4\" has to wait for that check to have had time to complete, not just\ncatch the transient pre-correction URL). Two targeted mutations (reverting\nchapter4Blocked to the fail-closed default always, dropping goToChapter4''s\nnavigate call) are each caught by exactly the check meant to catch them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"82c9319ef1f4979785d098e4b93e1cfcae9744c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/trees/82c9319ef1f4979785d098e4b93e1cfcae9744c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/commits/e3b6b91425ca6d736c1d59346c2a58db430a0267","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"htt