,"verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T11:42:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commit/8f2a0ce61b7fff85252642d456e68ea30ce269f5","node_id":"C_kwDOUYV0zNoAKDhmMmEwY2U2MWI3ZmZmODUyNTI2NDJkNDU2ZTY4ZWEzMGNlMjY5ZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commit/84cbebc9bbeada958926e0edc677e0db9c55cca8","sha":"84cbebc9bbeada958926e0edc677e0db9c55cca8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/84cbebc9bbeada958926e0edc677e0db9c55cca8"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commit/8e4285607dcb6987ade36be2cbcefceb1fcbc404","sha":"8e4285607dcb6987ade36be2cbcefceb1fcbc404","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/8e4285607dcb6987ade36be2cbcefceb1fcbc404"}],"sha":"8f2a0ce61b7fff85252642d456e68ea30ce269f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/8f2a0ce61b7fff85252642d456e68ea30ce269f5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/8e4285607dcb6987ade36be2cbcefceb1fcbc404/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T11:20:36Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T11:20:36Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"message":"Project routes, PR 2/4: setup and dataset\n\nSecond of four PRs building Stage 2 (see PR 1, #59, and the real-routes-plan\nmemory note). Setup and dataset are now real routes -- /project/:id/setup and\n/project/:id/dataset -- so reloading either, or opening it as a deep link,\nstays on that screen instead of dropping to the blank new-project form.\nReview, analysis and chapter4 are not routed yet (their own PRs), but a\nbare /project/:id already resolves correctly for ALL five outcomes (reusing\nPR1''s resolver), so reload survives for those too -- it just normalizes down\nto the bare id rather than getting its own bookmarkable sub-path until its\nstage lands.\n\n- select() is now also the URL-restore entry point (a reload, a deep link, or\n  the browser''s Back/Forward button), with push:false and, for an explicit\n  setup/dataset request, requestedStep so a bookmark to either is honoured\n  via resolveProjectStep rather than silently overridden by the project''s\n  default. A malformed id makes no request (R1). A 404 conversation (deleted\n  or foreign) clears state, drops any last-visited pointer to it, and shows\n  a one-time notice instead of a generic error banner (an improvement for\n  the existing sidebar-click path too, not just the new one).\n- newChat pushes /project/:id/setup; saveSetup''s Continue pushes\n  /project/:id/dataset; a new backToSetup() makes the header''s Back button\n  from Dataset history-aware (steps back when there is an earlier in-app\n  entry, otherwise pushes /setup directly) -- the Chapter4/Analysis/Review\n  Back branches are untouched. Deleting the active project now replaces to\n  \"/\". All per the approved history table (decision 4).\n- Bare \"/\" reopens the last-visited project on its last step (decision 2),\n  written to localStorage only from an already-resolved, allowed view.\n- projectRoutes.js gains parseProjectPath/projectPath (URL <-> {id, step},\n  same tolerance as viewRoutes.js''s settings-path helpers) and\n  historyBackTarget (the general form of viewRoutes.js''s\n  settingsBackTarget, generalized to take a caller-supplied fallback since\n  the project Back button pushes its fallback rather than replacing, unlike\n  Settings).\n- api.js''s existing id percent-encoding (PR 1) now protects every one of\n  these new navigate() calls too.\n\nInternal step names (setup/upload/review/workspace/chapter4) are unchanged\nthroughout the render tree -- only translated at the URL boundary -- to keep\nthis diff to exactly the setup/dataset wiring described here.\n\nChecked in a real browser (mock backend, headless Edge): 22 checks, including\nthe reported bug itself (reload on dataset stays on dataset) and its Back-arrow\ncounterpart (reload on setup). The same harness fails on the pre-PR2 code, and\ntwo targeted mutations (dropping the 404 handler, dropping the last-visited\nwrite) are each caught by exactly the check meant to catch them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5e32d164af40ea25f849e5b6d29e3288d948379","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/trees/e5e32d164af40ea25f849e5b6d29e3288d948379"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/commits/8e4285607dcb6987ade36be2cbcefceb1fcbc404","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commit/8e4285607dcb6987ade36be2cbcefceb1fcbc404","node_id":"C_kwDOUYV0zNoAKDhlNDI4NTYwN2RjYjY5ODdhZGUzNmJlMmNiY2VmY2ViMWZjYmM0MDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commit/84cbebc9bbeada958926e0edc677e0db9c55cca8","sha":"84cbebc9bbeada958926e0edc677e0db9c55cca8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/84cbebc9bbeada958926e0edc677e0db9c55cca8"}],"sha":"8e4285607dcb6987ade36be2cbcefceb1fcbc404","u