https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/0bf49ec5a4019b4f9683873951f06e688a5a8a92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T15:16:48Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T15:16:48Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"message":"Header \"Continue to Chapter 4\" follows the same rule as the action bar\n\nDuring a qualitative finalize the action bar under the findings was correctly\ndisabled, but the \"Continue to Chapter 4\" link in the page header stayed live\nand went straight to Chapter 4. The rule (\"no source still needs review, and\nresults are not out of date\") was worked out inline in the action bar only; the\nheader''s only condition was that an analysis exists, and goToChapter4 checked\nnothing more. The header therefore also ignored out-of-date results.\n\nMove the rule into chapter4Gate() and use it in all three places: the action bar\n(same wording as before), the header link (disabled, with the reason as its\ntooltip), and goToChapter4 itself, so any caller is refused. The server already\nrefuses to generate or download the chapter in these cases; this tells the\nresearcher up front instead of on download.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d5db5d2c887d620e0ed8b34e3a3b1908a9484dbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/trees/d5db5d2c887d620e0ed8b34e3a3b1908a9484dbe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/commits/0bf49ec5a4019b4f9683873951f06e688a5a8a92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following