0\nrows\"), which say nothing happened.\n\nappliedSteps() now drops steps with no changed rows and merges the\nrating-scale steps of one grid into a single row listing its columns, with a\nreason worded from the shared scale (the per-column reasons each name that\ncolumn''s own hidden copy, so none can stand for the group). A grouped row\nshows total values only: the columns'' row counts overlap and can''t be added.\nThe \"automatic fixes applied\" count follows the visible list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"228de53e8927948ec3faca0954902943945fa14c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/trees/228de53e8927948ec3faca0954902943945fa14c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/commits/ff9a112f8b7646893bdf1b878f2391f5f2f6f623","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commit/ff9a112f8b7646893bdf1b878f2391f5f2f6f623","node_id":"C_kwDOUYV0zNoAKGZmOWEx