hat running the analysis again is charged.\n\nAdd the re-run cost to the reset sentence in both confirmations, still only\nwhen the version is active. The number is the backend''s configured\ncosts.analysis (GET /credits, already loaded by the app), passed down to\nDatasetReview -- not hardcoded. If it has not loaded, the sentence keeps its\nold wording rather than name a number.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b07b74dd8737bb94a570a27b26fcf7f400ae7f57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/trees/b07b74dd8737bb94a570a27b26fcf7f400ae7f57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/commits/5df83b5519dd123225e8afac641df026decf2f5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commit/5df83b5519dd123225e8afac641df026decf2f5f","node_id":"C_kwDOUYV0zNoAKDVkZjgzYjU1MTlkZDEyMzIyNWU4YWZhYzY0MWRmMDI2ZGVjZjJmNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/