y}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commits/ea9f7ec0d441e37e94213d2add5bb9cb75661915/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T18:25:27Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T18:25:27Z","email":"owusugodman@gmail.com","name":"geep97"},"message":"Show a chapter4-affordability heads up after a qualitative finalize\n\nQualitative finalize now charges credits per column (see the backend\ncompanion change), deducted at the moment it starts. A researcher who\nfinalizes a column and is then short for the 50-credit Chapter 4\ndownload used to only find out when they clicked download and hit\nChapter4.jsx''s existing CreditActionButton block -- correct, but late.\n\n- chapter4AffordabilityWarning(balance, costs) (qualitativeFinalizePolling.js):\n  pure check against the same GET /credits balance+costs shape the rest\n  of the app already reads its costs from, never a hardcoded number.\n- onQualitativeFinalized() (useThesisWorkflow.js) now refreshes credits\n  after a finalize completes -- the local balance copy has been stale\n  since the backend charged it at finalize START, not completion.\n- ThesisWorkspace''s \"Continue to Chapter 4\" action bar shows the notice\n  as an earlier, plain heads up (not a block -- Chapter4.jsx''s own\n  CreditActionButton stays the actual gate on the download itself).\n\nConsidered and rejected: checking this inside QualitativeReview.jsx\nitself, where the finalize button lives -- that component unmounts\nalmost immediately after completion (the parent swaps it for a\nread-only result view), so a warning set there would never be seen.\n\n3 new tests in qualitativeFinalizePolling.test.js.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d92129a4ba98d79f34aba0382ac4dbc6e01379b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/trees/d92129a4ba98d79f34aba0382ac4dbc6e01379b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/git/commits/ea9f7ec0d441e37e94213d2add5bb9cb75661915","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71272701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/geep97","id":71272701,"login":"geep97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjcyNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geep97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ADANSEORG/adanse-frontend/commit/ea9f7ec0d441e37e94213d2add5bb9cb7566191