elouis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/venelouis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/venelouis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rullst/examples/commits/c5d4df60ef991f44ea8dc32d56f64d0ed7cdb2f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T01:57:44Z","email":"venelouistyago@gmail.com","name":"venelouis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T01:57:44Z","email":"venelouistyago@gmail.com","name":"venelouis"},"message":"feat(lms): integrate AI Copilot, fix CSP, language detection and test suite\n\n- Add LMS Academic Copilot (ai_controller.rs) with Groq/Llama-3.3 cloud\n  AI and offline fallback tutor for Rust & Rullst questions\n- Add GROQ_API_KEY support with multiple env var aliases (GROQ_KEY,\n  GROQ_TOKEN, OPENAI_API_KEY) and smart offline fallback\n- Set English as default language; Portuguese responses only when the\n  user writes in Portuguese (is_portuguese heuristic)\n- Extend is_portuguese() markers: add ''o que'', ''quero'', ''preciso'',\n  ''linguagem'', ''programação'', ''é um/uma'', ''são'', ''tem'', ''funciona'' etc.\n- Add Zero-Trust guardrail: blocks credential/password queries for Nexus\n  and Studio (admin paths), directs students to /login demo account\n- Fix BUG-001: replace external raw.githubusercontent.com favicon URLs\n  with local /favicon.ico in all 3 lms.rs page templates (CSP violation)\n- Fix BUG-002: is_portuguese() did not detect ''o que é o Rullst?''\n- Fix BUG-003: index_page() call in migration test missing csrf_token arg\n- Add 3 unit tests for AI controller (English default, PT detection,\n  guardrail passthrough for pedagogical questions)\n- Update lms.rs chat UI to full English (Send button, placeholders,\n  welcome message, balloon hint text)\n- Add studio.css and tailwind.js static assets\n- Rename docs/lms-erros-found.md -> docs/lms-errors-found.md (typo fix)\n  and add full bug report with root cause and fix details\n\nAll 17 tests pass: 0 failed","tree":{"sha":"544a3c40b897f35bbcd2e65458c48d1bcf9661a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rullst/examples/git/trees/544a3c40b897f35bbcd2e65458c48d1bcf9661a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rullst/examples/git/commits/c5d4df60ef991f44ea8dc32d56f64d0ed7cdb2f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37526748?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/venelouis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/venelouis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/venelouis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/venelouis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/venelouis","id":37526748,"login":"venelouis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTI2NzQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/venelouis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/venelouis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/venelouis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/venelouis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/venelouis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/venelouis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rullst/examples/commit/c5d4df60ef991f44ea8dc32d56f64d0ed7cdb2f1","node_id":"C_kwDOUYmY-9oAKGM1ZDRkZjYwZWY5OTFmNDRlYThkYzMyZDU2ZjY0ZDBlZDdjZGIyZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rullst/examples/commit/f55b6791ba94fbd6be4639e0f9e65ac74713300b","sha":"f55b6791ba94fbd6be4639e0f9e65ac74713300b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rullst/examples/commits/f55b6791ba94fbd6be4639e0f9e65ac74713300b"}],"sha":"c5d4df60ef991f44ea8dc32d56f64d0ed7cdb2f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rullst/examples/commits/c5d4df60ef991f44ea8dc32d56f64d0ed7cdb2f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https:/