 IBKR Signal & Scanner Engine, and the new\nCareerNaukri project. Added Project.imageUrl/imageAlt, wired into both\nthe /work grid and detail-page heroes plus og:image, with the first\ngrid row set to eager-load (fixes an NG0913 LCP warning).\n\nCareerNaukri (Mrityunjay1997/JobSearch) is a new project entry -\nverified directly against the running app and its Django models/views\nbefore writing any site copy, including two negative findings (no\nreal resume app, no real test suite) that were deliberately left out\nof the description.\n\nibkr-signal-scanner''s GitHub link was previously withheld over a\ncommitted secret in config.ini; added now that the user confirmed the\nsecret was rotated (the repo''s git history itself is unchanged, which\nPROGRESS.md notes for the record).\n\nRemoved the Nightwatch Platform project per user request, including\nits slug reference, sitemap entry, and e2e coverage (repointed to\nenterprise-data-pipelines).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb090c033b1cf30233943fdf3b71e87c4ee0f711","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/git/trees/cb090c033b1cf30233943fdf3b71e87c4ee0f711"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/git/commits/41bb7a74ac1bbe01177062c8d38c8fcc69aadce7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134798398?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver","id":134798398,"login":"letusDeliver","node_id":"U_kgDOCAjcPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/or