l":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/commits/e72ba0cc23dedc0d73ad9d058a1d6ee0537dd878/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T04:41:48Z","email":"singhkunal2608@gmail.com","name":"letusDeliver"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T04:41:48Z","email":"singhkunal2608@gmail.com","name":"letusDeliver"},"message":"Wire Start a Project form to the real backend, fix contact-form UX gaps\n\nReplace the mocked contact submission with the real Django backend for\nlocal dev: snake_case field mapping verified against the backend''s own\nDRF OPTIONS metadata (not guessed), real success/400/429 handling, and\nper-field backend error display. Production stays mocked until a real\nbackend is deployed.\n\nAlso fixes four issues found after trying the live form: submitting\nmultiple times, no way to remove a chosen attachment, no confirmation\ntoast on success, and fields accepting leading/trailing whitespace.\n\nUpdates MEMORY.md/CLAUDE.md/PROGRESS.md to record the new state and\nthe reasoning behind it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b35bc8bafa794bcc50cefdce99e62d0a06ceff72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/git/trees/b35bc8bafa794bcc50cefdce99e62d0a06ceff72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/git/commits/e72ba0cc23dedc0d73ad9d058a1d6ee0537dd878","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134798398?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/gists{/gist_id}","