RY.md for session continuity\n\nCLAUDE.md is the operating guide (content-integrity rules, git workflow,\nthe verification checklist, why the VS Code Problems panel isn''t the\nlint source of truth here, the WCAG contrast method, the scroll-before-\nscreenshot gotcha, the image-processing workflow). MEMORY.md is a\n30-second \"where are we\" snapshot — what''s done, what''s genuinely still\nopen, and the last few changes — meant to stay current going forward,\nunlike PROGRESS.md''s append-only detailed log. Neither duplicates\nPROGRESS.md; both point into it for full rationale.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d030b1304eda3a91c45f35a849e1ef779a82318","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/git/trees/4d030b1304eda3a91c45f35a849e1ef779a82318"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/git/commits/9953905580ac4ab376e74118cec5baf2acdf8ce2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134798398?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver","id":134798398,"login":"letusDeliver","node_id":"U_kgDOCAjcPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/commit/9953905580ac4ab376e74118cec5baf2acdf8ce2","node_id":"C_kwDOUYwVBNoAKDk5NTM5MDU1ODBhYzRhYjM3NmU3NDExOGNlYzViYWYyYWNkZjhjZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/commit/d8dde8af4358528ab2c9dc6d56576f319e536b3e","sha":"d8dde8af4358528ab2c9dc6d56576f319e536b3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/commits/d8dde8af4358528ab2c9dc6d56576f319e536b3e"}],"sha":"9953905580ac4ab376e74118cec5baf2acdf8ce2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/commits/9953905580ac4ab376e74118cec5baf2acdf8ce2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134798398?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver","id":134798398,"login":"letusDeliver","node_id":"U_kgDOCAjcPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/commits/d8dde8af4358528ab2c9dc6d56576f319e536b3e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T15:01:05Z","email":"singhkunal2608@gmail.com","name":"letusDeliver"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T15:01:05Z","email":"singhkunal2608@gmail.com","name":"letusDeliver"},"message":"Move hero gradient stop-color out of inline style attributes\n\nMicrosoft Edge Tools'' webhint linter flags style=\"...\" attributes\n(no-inline-styles). Tailwind has no utility for SVG stop-color, so\nreplace the two inline var() styles with dedicated CSS classes in\nstyles.css instead — same rendered result, verified via screenshot.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38a41e2fd2690a1aae515e59f67c402044fe3677","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/git/trees/38a41e2fd2690a1aae515e59f67c402044fe3677"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/git/commits/d8dde8af4358528ab2c9dc6d56576f319e536b3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134798398?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver","id":134798398,"login":"letusDeliver","node_id":"U_kgDOCAjcPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/commit/d8dde8af4358528ab2c9dc6d56576f319e536b3e","node_id":"C_kwDOUYwVBNoAKGQ4ZGRlOGFmNDM1ODUyOGFiMmM5ZGM2ZDU2NTc2ZjMxOWU1MzZiM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/commit/058d663a0fa0f787c9575e8e05859d40ece592e9","sha":"058d663a0fa0f787c9575e8e05859d40ece592e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/commits/058d663a0fa0f787c9575e8e05859d40ece592e9"}],"sha":"d8dde8af4358528ab2c9dc6d56576f319e536b3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/commits/d8dde8af4358528ab2c9dc6d56576f319e536b3e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134798398?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver","id":134798398,"login":"letusDeliver","node_id":"U_kgDOCAjcPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/commits/058d663a0fa0f787c9575e8e05859d40ece592e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:56:49Z","email":"singhkunal2608@gmail.com","name":"letusDeliver"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:56:49Z","email":"singhkunal2608@gmail.com","name":"letusDeliver"},"message":"Add dark/light theme switcher\n\n- New ThemeService (signal-based, localStorage-persisted) toggled via a\n  sun/moon button in the header (desktop + mobile), with a blocking\n  inline script in index.html to avoid a flash of dark before hydration\n  for returning light-theme visitors.\n- Add a fully independent light palette in tokens.css, each color\n  contrast-verified against WCAG AA the same way the dark theme was —\n  not a naive inversion. Light mode needed genuinely darker accent\n  shades, since the dark theme''s accent-bright fails as text on white.\n- Introduce a dedicated --color-on-accent token and fix Button''s primary\n  variant, which had been coupling its text color to --color-background\n  only because that value happened to be dark; that coupling would have\n  silently broken once background became theme-dependent.\n- Replace the hardcoded hex colors in the homepage hero''s SVG pipeline\n  diagram (the only place in the app using literal colors instead of\n  theme tokens) with token-based classes/vars so it follows the toggle.\n- Document the whole system, including the deliberate choice not to\n  auto-detect prefers-color-scheme, in PROGRESS.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c2072caff79b1af19269b2829f6d1cd08650adc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/git/trees/c2072caff79b1af19269b2829f6d1cd08650adc8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/letusDeliver-portfolio/git/commits/058d663a0fa0f787c9575e8e05859d40ece592e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134798398?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/letusDeliver/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.co