vanJaiswal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtharvanJaiswal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtharvanJaiswal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtharvanJaiswal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AtharvanJaiswal","id":215893387,"login":"AtharvanJaiswal","node_id":"U_kgDODN5Fiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtharvanJaiswal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtharvanJaiswal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtharvanJaiswal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtharvanJaiswal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtharvanJaiswal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtharvanJaiswal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AtharvanJaiswal/CreatorConnect/commits/1239a5c3b7816beabbe463e63ae0f8af6b3be41f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T19:11:45Z","email":"atharvanjaiswal@gmail.com","name":"AtharvanJaiswal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T19:11:45Z","email":"atharvanjaiswal@gmail.com","name":"AtharvanJaiswal"},"message":"fix(security): remediate phase 3 audit findings\n\nM1 - JWT issuer fail-closed: verifyToken rejects all tokens when\n     SUPABASE_JWT_ISSUER is not configured; empty/whitespace issuer\n     is normalized to undefined; issuer is always enforced in jose\n     verifyOptions (no conditional skip path); ''issuer'' in options\n     distinguishes explicit empty from absent to prevent env fallback.\n\nM2 - Replace console.warn with Pino structured logger in UsersService;\n     cache invalidation failure logged via module-level pino(loggerConfig)\n     with structured fields (event, metric, userId, note) routing through\n     the application observability pipeline.\n\nM3 - Fix audit log previousStatus: capture user status BEFORE the\n     tx.user.update call inside the same transaction; audit record now\n     contains the accurate before-state and after-state.\n\nTests:\n- jwt-verifier.spec.ts: +5 regression tests (wrong issuer, empty issuer,\n  whitespace issuer, no client-control invariant, missing config).\n- audit-log.spec.ts: +4 regression tests (ACTIVE->SUSPENDED, SUSPENDED->ACTIVE,\n  ACTIVE->DEACTIVATED, previousStatus != newStatus invariant).\n- admin-concurrency.spec.ts: improve isolation to prevent cross-run and\n  cross-spec DB state leakage.\n\nConfig:\n- vitest.config.ts: add pool:forks + singleFork:true to enforce serial\n  file execution and shared-DB isolation in vitest workspace mode.","tree":{"sha":"991eef17266c63b1d15d0b6b31970b9c95052576","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AtharvanJaiswal/CreatorConnect/git/trees/991eef17266c63b1d15d0b6b31970b9c95052576"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AtharvanJaiswal/CreatorConnect/git/commits/1239a5c3b7816beabbe463e63ae0f8af6b3be41f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215893387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtharvanJaiswal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtharvanJaiswal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtharvanJaiswal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtharvanJaiswal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AtharvanJaiswal","id":215893387,"login":"AtharvanJaiswal","node_id":"U_kgDODN5Fiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtharvanJaiswal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtharvanJaiswal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtharvanJaiswal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtharvanJaiswal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ath