type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deepeshk1204/staff-engineer-academy/commits/a8bcd922e60959e544a4b4659df6cc6063eb8b35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T11:56:42Z","email":"deepesh.kumar@harness.io","name":"Deepesh Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T11:56:42Z","email":"deepesh.kumar@harness.io","name":"Deepesh Kumar"},"message":"feat: rebuild as a three-track Staff engineer academy\n\nReplace the single 42KB index.html with a modular zero-build static site.\n\nContent: 52 topics across Frontend Systems (19), Backend & Distributed\nSystems (17) and AI Engineering (16). Backend and AI are new; the\nfrontend material is ported and substantially expanded. 1707 blocks,\n67 diagrams, 464 flashcards, 101 drills, 189 quiz items.\n\nPractice layer: interview question bank, timed six-phase mock interview\nwith a self-grade rubric and gap analysis, spaced-repetition flashcards\n(SM-2), and per-topic drills with grading keys.\n\nEngine: hash router, typed content blocks rendered from data, command\npalette search over the whole corpus, lazy Mermaid that fails soft,\nlight/dark theming, localStorage-only persistence with JSON export.\n\nContent is schema-enforced by tools/validate.mjs.","tree":{"sha":"ecf37377a78377002b155e590a2b1af5a6e718df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deepeshk1204/staff-engineer-academy/git/trees/ecf37377a78377002b155e590a2b1af5a6e718df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deepeshk1204/staff-engineer-academy/git/commits/a8bcd922e60959e544a4b4659df6cc6063eb8b35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81554936?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepesh-ui/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepesh-ui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepesh-ui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.g