21bec34bb6a5709550aafb4cca25408a"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:39:49.783Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/commits/0414b5d69bcbd4a06c0de69c62883cacce4894d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T21:48:31Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T21:48:31Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: React 18 app beside React 19, widget examples, command palette, Tecton header, folder routes\n\nTwo React majors in one page: the shell builds a shared-library set per\nmajor (vite.shared18.config.ts with react18 aliases) and a classic boot\nscript in index.html fetches env, release and shared manifests, applies\nDevTools overrides, and inserts the import map (the shell''s major globally,\nother majors scoped to each MFE''s URL prefix) before any module loads.\nmfe build dedupes React, TanStack Router and React Aria to the app''s copy\nand generates TanStack Router folder routes from src/routes.\n\nPilot: apps/customers (React 18, folder routes) and apps/customer-card (a\ncontract-2 widget with typed props, an event, a popover and a cross-app\nlink) mounted by both apps; every MFE defines the same class and brand\ncolour with different values as a style-isolation probe.\n\nShell: header on Tecton''s AppFinder and ShellActions; command palette\n(Mod+K) with apps, actions and help; manifest shortcuts through Tecton''s\nshortcut registry; sample API with customers and a reset endpoint.\nDevTools: override drafts persist across tabs, per-row remove, Shared tab\nshows every major''s set and the scopes. Smoke test covers all of it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBJB8VokjvGZGqjbjnzxmE","tree":{"sha":"a118e72c281012636889d7d1cdc37f37f87cbf3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/git/trees/a118e72c281012636889d7d1cdc37f37f87cbf3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/git/commits/0414b5d69bcbd4a06c0de69c62883cacce4894d1","verification":{"payload":"tree a118e72c281012636889d7d1cdc37f37f87cbf3f\nparent 8d850143be957d827d6ea52a80682789ac4c1da1\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789422511 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789422511 +0000\n\nfeat: React 18 app beside React 19, widget examples, command palette, Tecton header, folder routes\n\nTwo React majors in one page: the shell builds a shared-library set per\nmajor (vite.shared18.config.ts with react18 aliases) and a classic boot\nscript in index.html fetches env, release and shared manifests, applies\nDevTools overrides, and inserts the import map (the shell''s major globally,\nother majors scoped to each MFE''s URL prefix) before any module loads.\nmfe build dedupes React, TanStack Router and React Aria to the app''s copy\nand generates TanStack Router folder routes from src/routes.\n\nPilot: apps/customers (React 18, folder routes) and apps/customer-card (a\ncontract-2 widget with typed props, an event, a popover and a cross-app\nlink) mounted by both apps; every MFE defines the same class and brand\ncolour with different values as a style-isolation probe.\n\nShell: header on Tecton''s AppFinder and ShellActions; command palette\n(Mod+K) with apps, actions and help; manifest shortcuts through Tecton''s\nshortcut registry; sample API with customers and a reset endpoint.\nDevTools: override drafts persist across tabs, per-row remove, Shared tab\nshows every major''s set and the scopes. Smoke test covers all of it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBJB8VokjvGZGqjbjnzxmE\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNdFA/Xr\n5LiIzoOT95R5sxYuYr3UYaLtFKnQz2piVc1FgGo47tBkwHURFoZ9nnndRIwBGkioRAQdWOmleakN\n+wk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-14T21:48:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-platform/commit/0414b5d69bcbd4