per-browser overrides mapping an MFE to a manifest.json\nURL, applied at boot before the release is pinned), Shared (the import map\nwith versions, integrity and which MFEs declare each library), Instances,\nActions, Navigation, Release, Telemetry. SDK: applyDevOverrides and storage\nhelpers, instance and telemetry change observers. CLI: mfe dev builds,\nserves dist/ with CORS, rebuilds on change. Shell build clears stale assets.\nSmoke test covers the panel and an override served by mfe dev.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBJB8VokjvGZGqjbjnzxmE","tree":{"sha":"c53fb98de7e1bdb29d7b276b143e5cbd25f1eb49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/git/trees/c53fb98de7e1bdb29d7b276b143e5cbd25f1eb49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/git/commits/8d850143be957d827d6ea52a80682789ac4c1da1","verification":{"payload":"tree c53fb98de7e1bdb29d7b276b143e5cbd25f1eb49\nparent 7452245391b6332067c3b7b17f37f0072585a9ae\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789418599 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789418599 +0000\n\nfeat: DevTools panel and mfe dev\n\n@platform/devtools: a Tecton-styled panel the shell loads as a lazy chunk\nwhen localStorage platform.devtools is \"true\". Tabs: MFEs (release entries,\nlifecycle state, per-browser overrides mapping an MFE to a manifest.json\nURL, applied at boot before the release is pinned), Shared (the import map\nwith versions, integrity and which MFEs declare each library), Instances,\nActions, Navigation, Release, Telemetry. SDK: applyDevOverrides and storage\nhelpers, instance and telemetry change observers. CLI: mfe dev builds,\nserves dist/ with CORS, rebuilds on change. Shell build clears stale assets.\nSmoke test covers the panel and an override served by mfe dev.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBJB8VokjvGZGqjbjnzxmE\n","reason":