 import specifiers in its generated\nmanifest entry, and the browser scripts fall back to Playwright''s own\nChromium when the container path is absent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBJB8VokjvGZGqjbjnzxmE","tree":{"sha":"77280cee5301d5a8fa576731991376d8f7ad5821","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/git/trees/77280cee5301d5a8fa576731991376d8f7ad5821"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/git/commits/a91fbea594283819445707c58aa3c8a12f44fdfa","verification":{"payload":"tree 77280cee5301d5a8fa576731991376d8f7ad5821\nparent 9277b47686111b1408cac80ec07e473697e7c685\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789356917 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789356917 +0000\n\nfix: run the local stack without spawning pnpm, for Windows\n\nscripts/up.mjs runs tsx, vite and the mfe CLI as node scripts resolved from\nthe workspace instead of spawning pnpm (pnpm.cmd on Windows is not found by\nspawn). mfe build writes forward-slash import specifiers in its generated\nmanifest entry, and the browser scripts fall back to Playwright''s own\nChromium when the container path is absent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBJB8VokjvGZGqjbjnzxmE\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQATqImRo\nTHghHeflHofDttBvU6lJ7IVFlAmPg0kFd8VG7JhHiOCIbdw/MOkqxut9tdu3TAJd1WAy8Fi1aY8T\nTQk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/fol