}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/commits/9277b47686111b1408cac80ec07e473697e7c685/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T03:30:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T03:30:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"chore: pnpm start runs the whole slice; dev registries accept --replace\n\nscripts/up.mjs starts the registry, builds, claims, publishes and promotes\nevery workspace app with an mfe field, then builds and serves the shell\n(pnpm dev: Vite dev server). mfe publish --replace overwrites a version on\na registry running without a token so a rebuild of the same version can be\npromoted while iterating.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBJB8VokjvGZGqjbjnzxmE","tree":{"sha":"034c21ce4331f88dca6e926f84c9d33102c82a36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/git/trees/034c21ce4331f88dca6e926f84c9d33102c82a36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/git/commits/9277b47686111b1408cac80ec07e473697e7c685","verification":{"payload":"tree 034c21ce4331f88dca6e926f84c9d33102c82a36\nparent e98f4ce8449936f25498739688a524d4272d375e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789356654 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789356654 +0000\n\nchore: pnpm start runs the whole slice; dev registries accept --replace\n\nscripts/up.mjs starts the registry, builds, claims, publishes and promotes\nevery workspace app with an mfe field, then builds and serves the shell\n(pnpm dev: Vite dev server). mfe publish --replace overwrites a version on\na registry running without a token so a rebuild of the same version can be\npromoted while iterating.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 