the app''s own copy); local action ids are qualified\nat registration; confirmation content is compared structurally; useBlocker\nregistrations are bridged. Browser smoke test in e2e/. Spec 0.8.40 and the\nexamples reflect the sdk/cli layout. Comments no longer cite spec sections.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBJB8VokjvGZGqjbjnzxmE","tree":{"sha":"ca97987325bbe405a42295db6755f1c50c6e256e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/git/trees/ca97987325bbe405a42295db6755f1c50c6e256e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/git/commits/e98f4ce8449936f25498739688a524d4272d375e","verification":{"payload":"tree ca97987325bbe405a42295db6755f1c50c6e256e\nparent ec0222e3b33a032a47639eac5c2837e4a07eed84\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789355807 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789355807 +0000\n\nfeat(shell): the shell, shared-library import map, end-to-end smoke, docs for the package layout\n\nThe shell fetches /platform-env.json and the release, builds its shared\nlibraries once (react, react-dom, react-aria-components, react-aria portal\nprovider, @platform/sdk) and injects the import map so it and every MFE use\none copy; header with alphabetical app switcher, page title, page-header\nactions, help and user menus, theme toggle; confirmation and unsaved-changes\ndialogs; sign-in, 403, 404, failed and maintenance pages; release polling;\ndev identity profiles; Dockerfile with an entrypoint that writes the env\ndocument. TanStack adapter moves to @platform/sdk/react/tanstack (bundled with\nthe app so the router is the app''s own copy); local action ids are qualified\nat registration; confirmation content is compared structurally; useBlocker\nregistrations are bridged. Browser smoke test in e2e/. Spec 0.8.40 and the\nexamples reflect the sdk/cli layout. Comments no longer cite spec sections.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthro