ermissions (§32–33). React adapter: createApp (TanStack route tree or\ncomponent), createWidget, hooks, MfeWidget, PlatformLink, portals to the\noverlay root. Test host over the same runtime with memory history.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBJB8VokjvGZGqjbjnzxmE","tree":{"sha":"dd964daef16a7658e2e22b7f17d8abe6f994eba3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/git/trees/dd964daef16a7658e2e22b7f17d8abe6f994eba3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/git/commits/05d0db390e3048965c0dbb332416e8eb771ab08b","verification":{"payload":"tree dd964daef16a7658e2e22b7f17d8abe6f994eba3\nparent cd7f75ca7bf17b529895f797d390f7e4bc55308e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789352459 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789352459 +0000\n\nfeat(sdk): core types, headless host runtime, React adapter, test host\n\nWorkspace scaffold plus @platform/sdk: Observer store (§9.3), definitions and\nfactories, mount contexts, lifecycle runner with startup timeouts (§13–14),\nnavigation coordinator with prefix ownership, blockers and history bridge\n(§23–26), widgets with contract and props validation (§29), action pipeline\nwith confirmations (§44), HTTP client with destination policy (§36), identity\nand permissions (§32–33). React adapter: createApp (TanStack route tree or\ncomponent), createWidget, hooks, MfeWidget, PlatformLink, portals to the\noverlay root. Test host over the same runtime with memory history.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBJB8VokjvGZGqjbjnzxmE\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIbU1tEq\ncYELyeMwEt4SFcuNE2yimAhd+ncG3Gn+jahYot8Cs5OafYWcWOQXAW7NeYYi1oY925r1wbG8cRTs\nigI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATUR