c772467dd53512b7a19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/git/trees/b4db30a6e197cf31daa40c772467dd53512b7a19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/git/commits/f65a9b0444ce9584398b567991b57ec54943e83b","verification":{"payload":"tree b4db30a6e197cf31daa40c772467dd53512b7a19\nparent 883b177c54eb9d330738cbe784bd90372d5ad30c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789350498 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789350498 +0000\n\ndocs(spec): 0.8.38 simplify overlays, no Tecton changes\n\nctx.overlayRoot is the only overlay API; Tecton components are used as\nin any React app, custom HTML goes into Dialog, DialogOverlay or a\nportal into overlayRoot, custom toasts use sonner directly, and a\nconfirmation is text or an app-resolved promise. Examples use Tecton''s\nreal component and prop names.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBJB8VokjvGZGqjbjnzxmE\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGUqA+9a\nP3EgcqRcovGraxEy9+sDUEOHInfsvTGRLl2RoPshWK392j07hxcYzLW6Pxa+4fBcT5S52W3VfFMb\nIAg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-14T01:48:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://a