thropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T01:42:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs(spec): 0.8.37 overlay model and escape hatches for custom content\n\nThe platform provides overlay containers, stacking, CSS scope, shortcut\nsuspension and close-on-unmount; React Aria inside the singleton\n@tecton/react owns focus, Escape and scroll lock. Dialogs, sheets,\ntoasts and action confirmations each get an escape hatch down to raw\nHTML, with the shell keeping the frame, buttons and result.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBJB8VokjvGZGqjbjnzxmE","tree":{"sha":"8d315d53ef11a93a88072eea47b1ded524ddfbea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/git/trees/8d315d53ef11a93a88072eea47b1ded524ddfbea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform/git/commits/883b177c54eb9d330738cbe784bd90372d5ad30c","verification":{"payload":"tree 8d315d53ef11a93a88072eea47b1ded524ddfbea\nparent 44d3f4a03142dc2b2354b55d7d3139baba8c6daa\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789350122 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789350122 +0000\n\ndocs(spec): 0.8.37 overlay model and escape hatches for custom content\n\nThe platform provides overlay containers, stacking, CSS scope, shortcut\nsuspension and close-on-unmount; React Aria inside the singleton\n@tecton/react owns focus, Escape and scroll lock. Dialogs, sheets,\ntoasts and action confirmations each get an escape hatch down to raw\nHTML, with the shell keeping the frame, buttons and result.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBJB8VokjvGZGqjbjnzxmE\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOLUH8qx\njSEYgtIoydqZpFPvh/08iX