（Defender/索引服务对新解压 .exe 的独占扫描）执行指数退避\n  重试（150ms 起步、2s 封顶、默认 ~10s 预算，Atomics.wait 同步休眠）\n- downloadLatestMoliBinary 安装路径的 copy/chmod/rename/rm（含降级\n  copy-in-place 兜底与 finally 清理）全部纳入重试保护；非锁错误\n  （如 ENOENT）保持立即抛出不被掩盖\n- CI windows-latest 上 \"downloadLatestMoliBinary returns existing binary\n  or downloads\" 因此稳定复现 EBUSY，本修复消除该竞态\n- 新增 3 项单元测试：重试至成功、非瞬态错误直通、超预算带上下文放弃\n- 测试套件 137 项全部通过","tree":{"sha":"509213e118c6b8c1d22e692fca88cbcac6e9aebd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GreyRaphael/dsh-web-fetch-moli/git/trees/509213e118c6b8c1d22e692fca88cbcac6e9aebd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GreyRaphael/dsh-web-fetch-moli/git/commits/89ac9ebfaf7dfd7d48a90d805959101585c36300","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14954916?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GreyRaphael","id":14954916,"login":"GreyRaphael","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTU0OTE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GreyRaphael/dsh-web-fetch-moli/commit/89ac9ebfaf7dfd7d48a90d805959101585c36300","node_id":"C_kwDOUZunT9oAKDg5YWM5ZWJmYWY3ZGZkN2Q0OGE5MGQ4MDU5NTkxMDE1ODVjMzYzMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://g