y@pku.edu.cn","name":"BeW2C10_gewei"},"message":"fix: 修复工程缺陷、性能瓶颈与能力断层并优化基准测试\n\n1. 优化 Cloudflare 盾默认等待机制，减少无意义死等与重试\n2. 单元测试环境下切断外网二进制下载，大幅提升单测稳定性与速度\n3. 修复 Linux 环境下 GNU tar 解包 utime 权限报错并增加非致命警告回退\n4. 修正 moli-resolve 单元测试粗糙类型断言导致的空指针崩溃\n5. 优化 settleDynamicSpa 为指数退避轮询，降低 CDP 通信负载\n6. 清理 markdown 中特定站点硬编码类名，消除冗余 DOM 字符串拷贝\n7. 填平 CLI 模式与 CDP 模式参数断层（透传 layout/resource/waitUntil/insecure）\n8. 保持微前端滚动加载节奏与百炼基准测试验证（全量提取 179 张卡片）","tree":{"sha":"5aa76bac75f4334fc752dc30a86d339ba2996a96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GreyRaphael/dsh-web-fetch-moli/git/trees/5aa76bac75f4334fc752dc30a86d339ba2996a96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GreyRaphael/dsh-web-fetch-moli/git/commits/c0c640e5001d4d65cf12e9d7512d575f61b63810","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14954916?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GreyRaphael","id":14954916,"login":"GreyRaphael","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTU0OTE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GreyRaphael/dsh-web-fetch-moli/commit/c0c640e5001d4d65cf12e9d7512d575f61b63810","node_id":"C_kwDOUZunT9oAKGMwYzY0MGU1MDAxZDRkNjVjZjEyZTlkNzUxMmQ1NzVmNjFi