n","name":"BeW2C10_gewei"},"message":"feat(resolve): 插件升级时自动检测并从 GitHub Releases 覆盖更新最新版 Moli 内核\n\n- 增加插件版本标记机制（~/.cache/moli/.plugin-version），仅在插件升级或首次运行时触发更新检测，日常调用 0 网络开销\n- 直接通过 GitHub Releases latest 302 重定向解析最新版本 tag，规避 GitHub API Rate Limit\n- 下载支持优先使用系统 curl（自动继承 http_proxy/https_proxy 环境变量）并带原生 fetch 兜底\n- 下载解压后通过 renameSync 实现原子文件替换，避免 Linux/Windows 下覆写运行中文档引发崩溃\n- 移除本地源码编译路径依赖，统一以 GitHub 官方平台 release 二进制为单一分发源\n- 增加版本检测、Tag 获取与快速跳过路径等单元测试，全套测试与百炼 179 卡片基准测试均通过","tree":{"sha":"d6c6914c7489a66dbc312e10a2ad8be1a15c650a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GreyRaphael/dsh-web-fetch-moli/git/trees/d6c6914c7489a66dbc312e10a2ad8be1a15c650a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GreyRaphael/dsh-web-fetch-moli/git/commits/404900e84c6dfcdbf0bf2b67825e17e6e1573ae1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14954916?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GreyRaphael","id":14954916,"login":"GreyRaphael","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTU0OTE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GreyRaphael/dsh-web-fetch-moli/commit/404900e84c6dfcdbf0bf2b67825e17e6e1573ae1","node_id":"C_kwDOUZunT9oA