hael/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GreyRaphael","id":14954916,"login":"GreyRaphael","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTU0OTE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GreyRaphael/dsh-web-fetch-moli/commits/87360594687126274b787a0c369aa06417f01149/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T02:53:33Z","email":"grey@pku.edu.cn","name":"csc_d13_gewei"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T02:53:33Z","email":"grey@pku.edu.cn","name":"csc_d13_gewei"},"message":"fix: 修复复杂 SPA / 列表卡片数据截断与文档导航超时问题并升级至 v0.3.3\n\n- markdown: 增加对 Readability 虚假正文（False Positive）的比例判定，避免在模型市场/电商等卡片列表页面因误选底部微小 Banner 而丢弃主体卡片内容，无法提取文章时无缝回退全量干净正文\n- config: 规范 contextMode 隔离机制，针对本地 managed Moli 守护进程默认启用 isolated 独立上下文，避免跨站/跨子域的 Service Worker 与 Cookie 交叉污染\n- provider: 优化 Sentinel 等待逻辑，智能识别大段长文本文档页面并跳过冗余的 8 秒无限滚动等待；增加 SPA 水合沉降等待，确保动态微前端组件加载完全\n- cdp-client: 增加 goto 与 waitForLoadState 的 active readyState 保底轮询与 inFlight 防堆积机制，杜绝偶发 CDP 事件丢失引起的导航挂起","tree":{"sha":"bb80db2c8ba9ecafc72cb459d2164f43afd06bfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GreyRaphael/dsh-web-fetch-moli/git/trees/bb80db2c8ba9ecafc72cb459d2164f43afd06bfa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GreyRaphael/dsh-web-fetch-moli/git/commits/87360594687126274b787a0c369aa06417f01149","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14954916?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreyRaphael/events{/