依赖\n\n- 恢复 app/ui/main_window.py：曾被误改写为21行残缺stub（三引号未闭合\n  导致 PyInstaller 标记 invalid module，进而整条 UI 模块链未打包），\n  从 git 历史恢复完整 1485 行版本\n- fix(core/model_router): _mock_shortcircuit 用 __spec__ 判别真实 openai\n  模块与测试打桩对象，修复首次导入发生在打桩期间时守卫失效的缺陷\n- fix(core/model_router): 补缺失的 import sys（NameError）\n- fix(tests): test_model_router2 假客户端 create() 对齐真实 SDK 的 timeout\n  参数；test_compliance_qa / test_update_checker_offline 补 sys.path 引导\n- build(spec): collect_submodules(''app'') 全量收集，杜绝延迟 import 漏包\n- build: 构建环境补齐 requirements 既有依赖 fastapi/uvicorn/matplotlib/\n  pyqtgraph/pypinyin\n- 测试 91/91 全过；打包冒烟验证：进程存活、主窗口正常、行情拉取正常","tree":{"sha":"c5fddbce9725115a9bc04415b20dd1f11271b5f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShuYing07/Penumbra/git/trees/c5fddbce9725115a9bc04415b20dd1f11271b5f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShuYing07/Penumbra/git/commits/b976b4a665e0efc1c24797ecf364c28e0632546a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321447617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShuYing07/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShuYing07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShuYing07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShuYing07/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ShuYing07","id":321447617,"login":"ShuYing07","node_id":"U_kgDOEyjmwQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShuYing07/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShuYing07/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShuYing07/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShuYing07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShuYing07/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShuYing07","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ShuYing07/Penumbra/