\nselection applies. An explicit api route still trusts what was typed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ACdKJmXfzvwfCCLneCWd12","tree":{"sha":"3c207a26a8016e2076de8b04f1c5868ccb97cb70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/git/trees/3c207a26a8016e2076de8b04f1c5868ccb97cb70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/git/commits/7903f3af728dfa0a77efafb91244dc353c4be77f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215751653?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Unconfirmed2","id":215751653,"login":"Unconfirmed2","node_id":"U_kgDODNwb5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/commit/7903f3af728dfa0a77efafb91244dc353c4be77f","node_id":"C_kwDOUZ4YAdoAKDc5MDNmM2FmNzI4ZGZhMGE3N2VmYWZiOTEyNDRkYzM1M2M0YmU3N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/commit/6f408a658a455fd3f5769c9628571b7699ced41d","sha":"6f408a658a455fd3f5769c9628571b7699ced41d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/commits/6f408a658a455fd3f5769c9628571b7699ced41d"}],"sha":"7903f3af728dfa0a77efafb91244dc353c4be77f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/commits/7903f3af728dfa0a77efafb91244dc353c4be77f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215751653?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Unconfirmed2","id":215751653,"login":"Unconfirmed2","node_id":"U_kgDODNwb5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/commits/6f408a658a455fd3f5769c9628571b7699ced41d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T23:03:41Z","email":"eugene.turetsky@gmail.com","name":"Eugene Turetsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T23:03:41Z","email":"eugene.turetsky@gmail.com","name":"Eugene Turetsky"},"message":"Multi-AI: reference labels use the agent''s code; unique codes per chat; status line follows agent edits\n\nFound in the live CLI test: two Claude Code seats both labelled 0101CL.\nMessages now carry the agent code (SL/SH, CX for Codex, CG2 for a second\nChatGPT seat) and refLabel prefers it; claude-cli/codex-cli get CC/CX.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ACdKJmXfzvwfCCLneCWd12","tree":{"sha":"d85cf186a00753c0fdae2b24b0ff999ae1ed15dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/git/trees/d85cf186a00753c0fdae2b24b0ff999ae1ed15dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/git/commits/6f408a658a455fd3f5769c9628571b7699ced41d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215751653?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Unconfirmed2","id":215751653,"login":"Unconfirmed2","node_id":"U_kgDODNwb5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/commit/6f408a658a455fd3f5769c9628571b7699ced41d","node_id":"C_kwDOUZ4YAdoAKDZmNDA4YTY1OGE0NTVmZDNmNTc2OWM5NjI4NTcxYjc2OTljZWQ0MWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/commit/a3adb1f7dc5d3030fc1b9d2d6343ef00163d22a5","sha":"a3adb1f7dc5d3030fc1b9d2d6343ef00163d22a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/commits/a3adb1f7dc5d3030fc1b9d2d6343ef00163d22a5"}],"sha":"6f408a658a455fd3f5769c9628571b7699ced41d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/commits/6f408a658a455fd3f5769c9628571b7699ced41d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215751653?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Unconfirmed2","id":215751653,"login":"Unconfirmed2","node_id":"U_kgDODNwb5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/commits/a3adb1f7dc5d3030fc1b9d2d6343ef00163d22a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T22:51:33Z","email":"eugene.turetsky@gmail.com","name":"Eugene Turetsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T22:51:33Z","email":"eugene.turetsky@gmail.com","name":"Eugene Turetsky"},"message":"Multi-AI: agents with routes (browser / API per Settings / Claude Code & Codex CLIs), models and efforts\n\nParticipants become agents: name + provider + route + model + effort + persona.\nThe same provider can sit at the table more than once (\"Opus max\" vs \"Sonnet\nlow\", \"GPT high\" vs \"GPT low\"), which is what a single-provider panel needs.\n\n- Routes: auto follows Settings (API mode on + key -> provider API with the\n  model chosen there or the agent''s own; else browser tab); browser; api\n  (falls back to the tab with a warning); cli for claude-cli / codex-cli,\n  run locally on the user''s subscription (electron/providers/cli.cjs:\n  one-shot, tool-less, empty scratch dir, <=2 parallel per CLI, abortable).\n- BYOK: reasoningEffort -> OpenAI reasoning_effort / Anthropic extended\n  thinking budget. Keys and API mode live only in Settings; the tab reads them.\n- Delta context falls back to bounded for one-shot routes; browser threads\n  are keyed per agent (multiai:<chat>:<agentId>:<gen>).\n- Renderer: Agents block (cards with provider/route/model/effort/persona,\n  quick-add, route status, Settings re-read); legacy participants migrate.\n- REST/MCP: create accepts agents, reads show resolved routes; labels use\n  agent codes.\n- Tests: core agents helpers, handlers (api/cli routes, fallback, stop),\n  MCP schema, BYOK effort payloads.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ACdKJmXfzvwfCCLneCWd12","tree":{"sha":"771a6d0e716a76f3ed328a1aead777f17d00cd72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/git/trees/771a6d0e716a76f3ed328a1aead777f17d00cd72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/git/commits/a3adb1f7dc5d3030fc1b9d2d6343ef00163d22a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215751653?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Unconfirmed2","id":215751653,"login":"Unconfirmed2","node_id":"U_kgDODNwb5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/commit/a3adb1f7dc5d3030fc1b9d2d6343ef00163d22a5","node_id":"C_kwDOUZ4YAdoAKGEzYWRiMWY3ZGM1ZDMwMzBmYzFiOWQyZDYzNDNlZjAwMTYzZDIyYTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/commit/462f956412c473a262064ad57e0e828a7a730858","sha":"462f956412c473a262064ad57e0e828a7a730858","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/commits/462f956412c473a262064ad57e0e828a7a730858"}],"sha":"a3adb1f7dc5d3030fc1b9d2d6343ef00163d22a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/commits/a3adb1f7dc5d3030fc1b9d2d6343ef00163d22a5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215751653?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Unconfirmed2","id":215751653,"login":"Unconfirmed2","node_id":"U_kgDODNwb5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/commits/462f956412c473a262064ad57e0e828a7a730858/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:49:09Z","email":"eugene.turetsky@gmail.com","name":"Eugene Turetsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:49:09Z","email":"eugene.turetsky@gmail.com","name":"Eugene Turetsky"},"message":"Multi-AI Chat: charter mode, HANDOFF routing, Gemini frame diagnostics; live-tested abort and per-chat threads\n\n- Charter mode (per chat, also via REST/MCP create): claim tags VERIFIED/UNVERIFIED/ASSUMED, agreement-needs-a-reason, mandatory HANDOFF/OPEN/COMPLETE trailer, HANDOFF → routing (next in round or first next round, including from a local agent''s posted message), rotating red-team seat marked in the feed.\n\n- Gemini engine logs per-frame candidate lengths (window.__proximaGeminiFrames) to pin down the stitched-reply parser bug.\n\n- REST/MCP version strings read package.json; createChat accepts the full option set.\n\n- Live test on this machine (dev checkout, shared profile): ChatGPT turns on per-chat threads, Stop aborted the in-flight call inside the tab (''Cancelled by user'', not retried) and the provider answered normally afterwards. Full suite 674/674.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ACdKJmXfzvwfCCLneCWd12","tree":{"sha":"888e13da20fc22cbee07e258e3abad84af5b020a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/git/trees/888e13da20fc22cbee07e258e3abad84af5b020a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/git/commits/462f956412c473a262064ad57e0e828a7a730858","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215751653?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/followe