","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Unconfirmed2","id":215751653,"login":"Unconfirmed2","node_id":"U_kgDODNwb5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/commits/20b5a8ab2c4418c572cdc2963c224bc122461051/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:24:36Z","email":"eugene.turetsky@gmail.com","name":"Eugene Turetsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:24:36Z","email":"eugene.turetsky@gmail.com","name":"Eugene Turetsky"},"message":"Multi-AI Chat: delta catch-up after provider errors, shared aux thread, bench repeat failures\n\n- Delta mode: an error starts a new provider generation so the next turn is a full catch-up (Gemini''s engine wipes its thread on any failure).\n\n- Judge/summary/title share one aux thread per chat and provider, rotated every 5 uses, instead of opening a new web conversation per call.\n\n- A participant that fails twice in a row is benched for the rest of the run with a system note.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ACdKJmXfzvwfCCLneCWd12","tree":{"sha":"cb90edd269169f218de343363a166ab910aa5f7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/git/trees/cb90edd269169f218de343363a166ab910a