ttps://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Unconfirmed2","id":215751653,"login":"Unconfirmed2","node_id":"U_kgDODNwb5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/commits/6cf76c30b0068b7894eea4b3643f56662b202f3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T08:48:13Z","email":"eugene.turetsky@gmail.com","name":"Eugene Turetsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T08:48:13Z","email":"eugene.turetsky@gmail.com","name":"Eugene Turetsky"},"message":"Multi-AI Chat: bounded context, per-chat provider threads, convergence, directed turns, REST for local agents\n\nFixes from the gap analysis of the tab against the PCA/Proxima transcripts:\n\n- Prompts are self-sufficient and bounded (recent window verbatim + condensed digest + pinned state summary) instead of re-sending the whole transcript; errors/passes never fed back (multiai-core.cjs).\n\n- One provider-side thread per chat per provider, rotated every 12 turns; judge/summary/title use fresh aux threads. No more bleed between chats, the MCP tools and the auto-titler.\n\n- Stop token (DONE) / PASS convergence ends runs early; optional parallel blind first round; assigned stances for 3+ debaters; @mention directed turns; state-summary compaction; Gemini engine picker.\n\n- Correctness: judge scope by (cycle, round); per-chat running state (no double runs, switching chats no longer re-enables Send); orchestrated steps recorded by main so background runs are kept; failed crew role stops the pipeline; workflow parser only treats real provider names as providers; local titles by default.\n\n- Store: atomic writes with rolling backup and corruption parking; renderer snapshots are upsert-only and merge with main-process appends; explicit deletes with tombstones.\n\n- REST /v1/multiai/* so Codex / Claude Code can list, read (since), append turns, run rounds and stop; route-extension hook in rest-api.cjs; WebSocket init no longer runs twice on port fallback.\n\n- Dev checkout uses its own userData (proxima-dev) and a per-profile single-instance lock; fork builds do not auto-update from upstream unless settings.autoUpdate=true.\n\n- Tests: tests/electron/ipc (29) covering store, prompt builder, run loop, cancellation, judge scope, REST. Docs: docs/MULTIAI.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ACdKJmXfzvwfCCLneCWd12","tree":{"sha":"a44286af589ab817220b1b0620d5a7f77c7cd4e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/git/trees/a44286af589ab817220b1b0620d5a7f77c7cd4e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Unconfirmed2/Proxima-MultiAI/git/commits/6cf76c30b0068b7894eea4b3643f56662b202f3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215751653?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unconfirmed2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"h