":"ouzhan.aslan@unionion.com","name":"Spirolina"},"message":"WebView microfrontend hızlandırma — native uygulama rehberi\n\nGömülü WebView''lerde React microfrontend çalıştıran native mobil uygulamalar\niçin, yalnızca native tarafta uygulanan 9 fazlık rehber. Microfrontend kaynak\nkoduna dokunulmaz.\n\n- Faz 0 keşif kapısı: envanter raporu ve onay olmadan kod yazılmaz\n- Enjekte edilen ölçüm probu, native route swap, hazır-olma sezgisi\n- Web işbirliği gerektiren her şey kapsam dışı eki olarak ayrı tutuldu\n- 39 anti-pattern, çürütülen iddialar, bilinçli boşluklar listesi\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0179xGqz76hRHce6eHgwFy46","tree":{"sha":"d5888facfab4533dfd0bea49f0ec99c12dfe5e3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Spirolina/webview-mfe-native-guide/git/trees/d5888facfab4533dfd0bea49f0ec99c12dfe5e3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Spirolina/webview-mfe-native-guide/git/commits/3d2beb229479c0a85c68b01ef1cdedac4cc2ce2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/251297176?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ouzhanaslan04/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ouzhanaslan04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ouzhanaslan04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ouzhanaslan04/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ouzhanaslan04","id":251297176,"login":"ouzhanaslan04","node_id":"U_kgDODvp9mA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ouzhanaslan04/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ouzhanaslan04/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ouzhanaslan04/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ouzhanaslan04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.git