users.noreply.github.com","name":"thy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T07:56:45Z","email":"213379314+okaythi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"thy"},"message":"fix(notation): octave lines follow figures and their own staff; hand reach in import\n\n- Octave lines cover whole figures, never a chord they would push onto\n  more ledger lines, and join across a one-bar gap when nothing forbids it.\n- A line governs only the notes drawn on its staff; a spanner may name its\n  staff for notes crossing from the other staff''s chord (bar 170).\n- A one-note line keeps its hook clear of the 8va mark.\n- Import: a note out of one hand''s reach joins the other hand''s chord.\n- Phones: two stacked full-width score lines sized to the free room.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1337d29174182bb56fe24a98e88ae0e1b8ff2e65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/git/trees/1337d29174182bb56fe24a98e88ae0e1b8ff2e65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/git/commits/ae7a1db52866cd5958cb796a0e432a913d3806a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213379314?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi","id":213379314,"login":"okaythi","node_id":"U_kgDODLfo8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.git