hy"},"message":"fix(score): finish いつも何度でも on the notation engine\n\nLine breaking may now tighten a line (to 70% of ideal spacing) to take\nanother measure. Without it a phone half held one bar instead of two, and\ndesktop lines held four or five bars instead of five or six.\n\nOctave lines start and stop at the chords whose top note needs them, so a\nlow chord opening the bar is no longer written an octave down (bar 90).\nTempo changes and \"a tempo\" sit above the system whichever hand they are\nanchored to, and anchor to the first chord in either staff. A deeper\nslowing becomes its own \"molto rit.\" change after the \"rit.\". A rolled\nchord marks its beat where the roll begins, which puts the performed\ntempo marks back on the bars the old engraving had them (71, 72, 120,\n122, 123, 166, 172, 177).\n\nAlso includes general layout fixes made alongside: exact curve bounds,\nslur lift by real clearance, staff gaps that grow to fit marks between\nstaves, and a frame that includes all ink.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7fd43b5e545391feb820a39a17d6ecc105ddfc1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/git/trees/7fd43b5e545391feb820a39a17d6ecc105ddfc1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/git/commits/d643895dbb0582ed11689a70533ba0dad2247a59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213379314?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi","id":213379314,"login":"okaythi","node_id":"U_kgDODLfo8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi/karaoke/commit/d643895dbb0582ed11689a70533ba0dad2247a59","node_id":"C_kwDOUaBsf9oAKGQ2NDM4OTVkYmIwNTgyZWQxMTY4OWE3MDUzM2JhMGRhZDIyNDdhNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi/karaoke/commit/f95efade4dc87a7502ae111adf1bd37d8845112a","sha":"f95efade4dc87a7502ae111adf1bd37d8845112a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/commits/f95efade4dc87a7502ae111adf1bd37d8845112a"}],"sha":"d643895dbb0582ed11689a70533ba0dad2247a59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/commits/d643895dbb0582ed11689a70533ba0dad2247a59"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213379314?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi","id":213379314,"login":"okaythi","node_id":"U_kgDODLfo8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/commits/f95efade4dc87a7502ae111adf1bd37d8845112a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T07:51:10Z","email":"213379314+okaythi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"thy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T07:51:10Z","email":"213379314+okaythi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"thy"},"message":"feat(score): notate いつも何度でも''s lower staff in baritone F clef\n\nAdds the baritone F clef (F on the third line) to the notation engine and\nswitches the song''s lower staff to it. The staff''s octave-line thresholds\ndrop by one ledger line so the same passages keep their octave lines.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2de77d3c95fa92a5bfb1f0b0f9053f8a53d80085","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/git/trees/2de77d3c95fa92a5bfb1f0b0f9053f8a53d80085"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/git/commits/f95efade4dc87a7502ae111adf1bd37d8845112a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213379314?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi","id":213379314,"login":"okaythi","node_id":"U_kgDODLfo8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi/karaoke/commit/f95efade4dc87a7502ae111adf1bd37d8845112a","node_id":"C_kwDOUaBsf9oAKGY5NWVmYWRlNGRjODdhNzUwMmFlMTExYWRmMWJkMzdkODg0NTExMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi/karaoke/commit/88cc47fb42a83c9370b53fbfe8e1f161255651bb","sha":"88cc47fb42a83c9370b53fbfe8e1f161255651bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/commits/88cc47fb42a83c9370b53fbfe8e1f161255651bb"}],"sha":"f95efade4dc87a7502ae111adf1bd37d8845112a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/commits/f95efade4dc87a7502ae111adf1bd37d8845112a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213379314?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi","id":213379314,"login":"okaythi","node_id":"U_kgDODLfo8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/commits/88cc47fb42a83c9370b53fbfe8e1f161255651bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:46:20Z","email":"213379314+okaythi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"thy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:46:20Z","email":"213379314+okaythi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"thy"},"message":"feat(score): move いつも何度でも to the notation engine and remove the old pipeline\n\nThe song''s score is now data: the aligned transcription as source, import\nsettings and nine reviewed source corrections in song.json, twelve\nreviewed edits, and a style sheet. General import passes replace the old\nbar-specific code: rolled chords become arpeggios, both hands striking\ntogether share a position, beats are read in sixteenths or triplets from\ntheir onsets, inner voices are separated, and notes last to the next onset\nunless their sound stopped. Octave lines and rit./a tempo/fermatas are\ninferred from the notes and the performance.\n\nAgainst the old engraving, 334 of 356 staff-bars match exactly; the rest\nput left-hand chords back on the beat, read the bar-172 run as triplets,\nmark every rolled chord the performer played, and draw cross-staff notes\nin the closing bars.\n\nThe theater shows the score through a song-agnostic view: lines fit the\nscore area, two halves side by side on phones, glides and a playhead on\nthe video''s clock. A score review page shows any song with inferred and\nedited elements highlighted. The old src/score pipeline, its data and the\nengraving fixture are gone; VexFlow is now only a build-time source of\nthe font files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"67302902d60bcb208183647a414d2856dc49b42d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/git/trees/67302902d60bcb208183647a414d2856dc49b42d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/git/commits/88cc47fb42a83c9370b53fbfe8e1f161255651bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213379314?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi","id":213379314,"login":"okaythi","node_id":"U_kgDODLfo8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi/karaoke/commit/88cc47fb42a83c9370b53fbfe8e1f161255651bb","node_id":"C_kwDOUaBsf9oAKDg4Y2M0N2ZiNDJhODNjOTM3MGI1M2ZiZmU4ZTFmMTYxMjU1NjUxYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi/karaoke/commit/22916c0ade1b878f0a2214c0c3bd1c987bf9f3f3","sha":"22916c0ade1b878f0a2214c0c3bd1c987bf9f3f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/commits/22916c0ade1b878f0a2214c0c3bd1c987bf9f3f3"}],"sha":"88cc47fb42a83c9370b53fbfe8e1f161255651bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/commits/88cc47fb42a83c9370b53fbfe8e1f161255651bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213379314?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi","id":213379314,"login":"okaythi","node_id":"U_kgDODLfo8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/commits/22916c0ade1b878f0a2214c0c3bd1c987bf9f3f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:21:21Z","email":"213379314+okaythi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"thy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:21:21Z","email":"213379314+okaythi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"thy"},"message":"feat(notation): add song-agnostic notation engine and gallery\n\nA notation engine that knows no song: a typed catalogue of 141 notations,\neach with its drawing, side, layer and examples; an exact-fraction score\nmodel; accidental, stem, beam and meter rules; spring spacing with\nfit-width line breaking; and one generic placer for every attachment and\nspanner, with shared baselines and contour avoidance. Glyphs are drawn from\nBravura metrics measured at build time, so layout runs without a DOM.\n\nRendering carries per-item style variables from a cascading style sheet\n(per song, staff, voice, role, tag, measure or note) and notehead glide\noverlays driven by a playback controller.\n\nThe admin notation gallery shows every catalogue entry and a styled\nplayback demo. The live score still uses the old pipeline.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"97b957b0f1ad886b188d0cdb2f523cd68b6d486a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/git/trees/97b957b0f1ad886b188d0cdb2f523cd68b6d486a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/git/commits/22916c0ade1b878f0a2214c0c3bd1c987bf9f3f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213379314?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi","id":213379314,"login":"okaythi","node_id":"U_kgDODLfo8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi/karaoke/commit/22916c0ade1b878f0a2214c0c3bd1c987bf9f3f3","node_id":"C_kwDOUaBsf9oAKDIyOTE2YzBhZGUxYjg3OGYwYTIyMTRjMGMzYmQxYzk4N2JmOWYzZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi/karaoke/commit/6c2f4a884f85d6394b7a51e595af7b919a4fd2fd","sha":"6c2f4a884f85d6394b7a51e595af7b919a4fd2fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/commits/6c2f4a884f85d6394b7a51e595af7b919a4fd2fd"}],"sha":"22916c0ade1b878f0a2214c0c3bd1c987bf9f3f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/commits/22916c0ade1b878f0a2214c0c3bd1c987bf9f3f3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213379314?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi","id":213379314,"login":"okaythi","node_id":"U_kgDODLfo8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/commits/6c2f4a884f85d6394b7a51e595af7b919a4fd2fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T11:20:49Z","email":"213379314+okaythi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"thy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T11:20:49Z","email":"213379314+okaythi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"thy"},"message":"fix(score): show bar 82''s triplet rest and bracket its first triplet below\n\nThe run enters after beat 1, so the triplet''s first eighth is a rest; it was\ndrawn transparent, leaving the bar two and a half beats long. The rest now\nshows on the middle line, and that triplet''s bracket is written under the\nstaff, clear of the 8va.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe381e4972315981438dd3f939d533434e6df2df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/git/trees/fe381e4972315981438dd3f939d533434e6df2df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okaythi/karaoke/git/commits/6c2f4a884f85d6394b7a51e595af7b919a4fd2fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213379314?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/okaythi","id":213379314,"login":"okaythi","node_id":"U_kgDODLfo8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okaythi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/okay