l for superapp hosts and clear mini-app load errors\n\n- Hosts get `dev:all`, which starts the host and every mini-app in\n  miniapps.json in one terminal, skips mini-apps already running, refuses\n  to reuse a running host (it may predate a new mini-app), and stops all\n  of them on Ctrl+C, force-killing any that ignore SIGTERM mid-compile.\n- Mini-app tabs catch load failures and say why (dev server not running,\n  or host not restarted) with a Reload app button, instead of a red screen.\n- add-miniapp only warns about restarting when the host''s dev server is\n  actually running, and points to dev:all.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4073e3626ae10afc2930cbad5a11d00d41fa2083","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ducdinh-codehub/dda-stack/git/trees/4073e3626ae10afc2930cbad5a11d00d41fa2083"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ducdinh-codehub/dda-stack/git/commits/7697ec566fa3d14c413c139c1f18ffc1e5e55813","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ducdinh-codehub/dda-stack/commit/7697ec566fa3d14c413c139c1f18ffc1e5e55813","node_id":"C_kwDOUaGxCdoAKDc2OTdlYzU2NmZhM2QxNGM0MTNjMTM5YzFmMThmZmMxZTVlNTU4MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ducdinh-codehub/dda-stack/commit/c336ab904045b899836ca3c614ff4707fd56ac7a","sha":"c336ab904045b899836ca3c614ff4707fd56ac7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ducdinh-codehub/dda-stack/commits/c336ab904045b899836ca3c614ff4707fd56ac7a"}],"sha":"7697ec566fa3d14c413c139c1f18ffc1e5e55813","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ducdinh-codehub/dda-stack/commits/7697ec566fa3d14c413c139c1f18ffc1e5e55813"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62693956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducdinh-codehub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducdinh-codehub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducdinh-co