85fa9b9fcc45730a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17949154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio","id":17949154,"login":"yazhouio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTQ5MTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/a4107336e098906ba5736efdc344879d7aba8703/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T10:34:17Z","email":"git@yazhou.io","name":"ya zhou"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T10:34:17Z","email":"git@yazhou.io","name":"ya zhou"},"message":"fix(release): grant publish permission and verify trust bindings\n\n`npm trust github` requires an explicit permission flag since npm\n11.15.0, so release:trust failed before creating any binding. Pass\n--allow-publish (release.yml publishes directly, not staged) and run\nthe trust commands through a pinned npm@11.19.1, since the npm bundled\nwith Node 24.14.1 predates the flag.\n\nThe already-trusted check only matched repository and workflow text, so\na binding with a missing or different environment, or with staged-only\npublish permission, was skipped although OIDC publishing would still\nfail. Parse the trust list and accept a binding only when repository,\nworkflow, environment and publish permission all match; revoke and\nrecreate same-workflow bindings that do not, then re-read to confirm.\n\nThe list is parsed from the pinned CLI''s text output because --json\nbuffers the 2FA authentication URL until exit, hiding the prompt.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"354ac3c5e1707136c6cfeadbc2fd3edbf9c4ca37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/git/trees/354ac3c5e1707136c6cfeadbc2fd3edbf9c4ca37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/git/commits/a4107336e098906ba5736efdc344879d7aba8703","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17949154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio","id":17949154,"login":"yazhouio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTQ5MTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commit/a4107336e098906ba5736efdc344879d7aba8703","node_id":"C_kwDOUaJ5TtoAKGE0MTA3MzM2ZTA5ODkwNmJhNTczNmVmZGMzNDQ4NzlkN2FiYTg3MDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commit/ee6eb4673a2da07665cbddfad9c26936eb819e2c","sha":"ee6eb4673a2da07665cbddfad9c26936eb819e2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/ee6eb4673a2da07665cbddfad9c26936eb819e2c"}],"sha":"a4107336e098906ba5736efdc344879d7aba8703","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/a4107336e098906ba5736efdc344879d7aba8703"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17949154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio","id":17949154,"login":"yazhouio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTQ5MTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/ee6eb4673a2da07665cbddfad9c26936eb819e2c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:19:53Z","email":"git@yazhou.io","name":"ya zhou"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:19:53Z","email":"git@yazhou.io","name":"ya zhou"},"message":"build(release): add package quality gates and OIDC publishing\n\nRename the workspace scope from @nexus to @feforgejs; the @nexus npm\norg belongs to another project.\n\n- publint + attw (pnpm check:packages) validate every publishable\n  package''s exports under bundler and node16 resolution\n- use explicit .js extensions for relative imports in plugin-runtime,\n  browser-host and console-core so their dist loads under Node ESM\n- enforce vitest coverage thresholds for plugin-runtime\n- commitlint via a lefthook commit-msg hook and CI, kept independent\n  of package versioning\n- changesets for versioning; release.yml publishes through npm trusted\n  publishing (OIDC) after a one-time local publish and\n  `pnpm release:trust`\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d557135f93a0ea68aca8836dc981c8a61ee3bd00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/git/trees/d557135f93a0ea68aca8836dc981c8a61ee3bd00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/git/commits/ee6eb4673a2da07665cbddfad9c26936eb819e2c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17949154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio","id":17949154,"login":"yazhouio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTQ5MTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commit/ee6eb4673a2da07665cbddfad9c26936eb819e2c","node_id":"C_kwDOUaJ5TtoAKGVlNmViNDY3M2EyZGEwNzY2NWNiZGRmYWQ5YzI2OTM2ZWI4MTllMmM","parents":[{"html_url"