llODQwODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commit/1fbd3bf1b89f143bf56cef3d4c1cd5407a8a4d32","sha":"1fbd3bf1b89f143bf56cef3d4c1cd5407a8a4d32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/1fbd3bf1b89f143bf56cef3d4c1cd5407a8a4d32"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commit/f26fa03a34a67c206019a2499347b1b18d1200a8","sha":"f26fa03a34a67c206019a2499347b1b18d1200a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/f26fa03a34a67c206019a2499347b1b18d1200a8"}],"sha":"f2bff324296f873b85072a1573118d4779e84082","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/f2bff324296f873b85072a1573118d4779e84082"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17949154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio","id":17949154,"login":"yazhouio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTQ5MTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/f26fa03a34a67c206019a2499347b1b18d1200a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:42:32Z","email":"git@yazhou.io","name":"ya zhou"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:42:32Z","email":"git@yazhou.io","name":"ya zhou"},"message":"fix: catch undeclared identifiers in the JavaScript scripts\n\nConfirmed: the gate was blind here. Oxlint files eslint/no-undef under\nnursery, so enabling correctness, suspicious and perf did not turn it\non, and `pnpm lint` stayed silent on a typo in a .mjs file.\n\ntsconfig sets allowJs: false, so the 38 Node and browser scripts under\nscripts/, e2e/, docs/validation/ and the plugin build helpers get no\ncompiler pass at all. Until now nothing checked them, and a misspelled\nidentifier in a branch CI does not exercise would have reached main.\n\nEnabled for the JS family only. TypeScript keeps it off because the\ncompiler already answers this there, and because build-time defines such\nas REMOTE_ORIGIN — declared for tsc but absent from the source — read as\nundefined identifiers to a rule that cannot see declarations. Running it\nover the TS sources turns up exactly that one false positive and nothing\nelse.\n\nCosts nothing today: all 38 existing JS-family files are already clean,\nso the counts stay at 0 errors and 34 warnings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3d6a1be2ee1aa91e82eef16da2d428ceddf86109","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/git/trees/3d6a1be2ee1aa91e82eef16da2d428ceddf86109"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/git/commits/f26fa03a34a67c206019a2499347b1b18d1200a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17949154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio","id":17949154,"login":"yazhouio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTQ5MTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commit/f26fa03a34a67c206019a2499347b1b18d1200a8","node_id":"C_kwDOUaJ5TtoAKGYyNmZhMDNhMzRhNjdjMjA2MDE5YTI0OTkzNDdiMWIxOGQxMjAwYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commit/c235e920ddce07b759b23bf3933bf15c78a1c923","sha":"c235e920ddce07b759b23bf3933bf15c78a1c923","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/c235e920ddce07b759b23bf3933bf15c78a1c923"}],"sha":"f26fa03a34a67c206019a2499347b1b18d1200a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/f26fa03a34a67c206019a2499347b1b18d1200a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17949154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio","id":17949154,"login":"yazhouio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTQ5MTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/c235e920ddce07b759b23bf3933bf15c78a1c923/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:28:20Z","email":"git@yazhou.io","name":"ya zhou"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:28:20Z","email":"git@yazhou.io","name":"ya zhou"},"message":"fix: address review on the tooling gate\n\nThree of the four review findings held up; one did not.\n\nConfirmed and fixed:\n\n- The pre-commit jobs ran with `parallel: true` while both rewrote and\n  restaged the same files, so the committed result depended on which\n  process finished last. They are serial now, oxlint first so that oxfmt\n  has the final word, which is what CI''s format:check verifies.\n\n- The warning budget did not enforce what it claimed. `--max-warnings`\n  caps a total; it cannot tell a fixed finding from a new one, and once\n  the backlog drops the slack is free for new violations. The backlog\n  rules are now errors everywhere and demoted only inside the fourteen\n  files that actually carry the thirty-four findings, listed explicitly\n  in an override. A new occurrence in any other file is an error, and\n  the cap still holds the line inside the baseline.\n\n- The committed validation evidence was being reformatted. Both\n  docs/validation/plugin-externalization-poc-results.json and\n  plugin-styling-ablation-results.json are written by their scripts with\n  JSON.stringify(_, null, 2), so rerunning either validation would have\n  left the tree failing format:check until oxfmt rewrote it again. All\n  eight JSON files under docs/validation turn out to be generator output\n  in exactly that form, so the whole directory is excluded rather than\n  the two that happened to differ, and the two reformatted files are\n  restored to what their generators emit.\n\nNot reproduced: the claim that the pre-commit glob only matches the\nrepository root. Staging packages/plugin-runtime/src/foo.ts and a file\nfour directories deep under apps/console/src both run the hook and get\nrewritten, while a .txt in the same directory is skipped with \"no files\nfor inspection\" — so the pattern is applied, and it matches nested paths\nunder lefthook 2.1.14''s default matcher.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dcdf7da803eb3ab4a89c43cad80955fc7d34c66f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/git/trees/dcdf7da803eb3ab4a89c43cad80955fc7d34c66f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/git/commits/c235e920ddce07b759b23bf3933bf15c78a1c923","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17949154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio","id":17949154,"login":"yazhouio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTQ5MTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commit/c235e920ddce07b759b23bf3933bf15c78a1c923","node_id":"C_kwDOUaJ5TtoAKGMyMzVlOTIwZGRjZTA3Yjc1OWIyM2JmMzkzM2JmMTVjNzhhMWM5MjM"