n":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commit/1fbd3bf1b89f143bf56cef3d4c1cd5407a8a4d32","node_id":"C_kwDOUaJ5TtoAKDFmYmQzYmYxYjg5ZjE0M2JmNTZjZWYzZDRjMWNkNTQwN2E4YTRkMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commit/887de45a81c61eec0e0282c609c9a5940056241c","sha":"887de45a81c61eec0e0282c609c9a5940056241c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/887de45a81c61eec0e0282c609c9a5940056241c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commit/e478c29f89b1056450d9e604308c016d6b38a44d","sha":"e478c29f89b1056450d9e604308c016d6b38a44d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/e478c29f89b1056450d9e604308c016d6b38a44d"}],"sha":"1fbd3bf1b89f143bf56cef3d4c1cd5407a8a4d32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/1fbd3bf1b89f143bf56cef3d4c1cd5407a8a4d32"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17949154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio","id":17949154,"login":"yazhouio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTQ5MTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/e20f705bd36772a8532751bfcc77b62d197dfd7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:38:58Z","email":"git@yazhou.io","name":"ya zhou"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:13:39Z","email":"git@yazhou.io","name":"ya zhou"},"message":"style: format the workspace with oxfmt\n\nOne-time reflow, no behaviour change. The codebase was written very\ndensely (several statements per line, one CSS rule per line), so the\ndiff is large: 214 files, mostly line expansion.\n\nMarkdown is excluded because the table aligner pads by character count\nand mangles the CJK documentation tables.\n\noxfmt also normalises package.json key order and sorts dependency maps,\nwhich is why every workspace manifest is touched.\n\nVerified after formatting: typecheck, 268 unit tests, 43 Playwright\nspecs, a full build, the styling compiler validation and the workspace\nboundary check all pass.\n\nAdd this commit to .git-blame-ignore-revs if you want blame to skip it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"46821967bdf5e3da345d27c095295b20c248455d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/git/trees/46821967bdf5e3da345d27c095295b20c248455d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/git/commits/e20f705bd36772a8532751bfcc77b62d197dfd7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17949154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio","id":17949154,"login":"yazhouio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTQ5MTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commit/e20f705bd36772a8532751bfcc77b62d197dfd7f","node_id":"C_kwDOUaJ5TtoAKGUyMGY3MDViZDM2NzcyYTg1MzI3NTFiZmNjNzdiNjJkMTk3ZGZkN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commit/c9e296cdb00f79398ce32c453175bc2545ad9db8","sha":"c9e296cdb00f79398ce32c453175bc2545ad9db8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/c9e296cdb00f79398ce32c453175bc2545ad9db8"}],"sha":"e20f705bd36772a8532751bfcc77b62d197dfd7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/e20f705bd36772a8532751bfcc77b62d197dfd7f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17949154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio","id":17949154,"login":"yazhouio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTQ5MTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/c9e296cdb00f79398ce32c453175bc2545ad9db8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:38:43Z","email":"git@yazhou.io","name":"ya zhou"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:13:39Z","email":"git@yazhou.io","name":"ya zhou"},"message":"fix: clear the findings oxlint reports as errors\n\nEverything the new linter flags as an error, so `lint` is green on its\nown terms before the formatter touches anything.\n\n- Drop eight unused type imports and one unused value import, an unused\n  catch binding, and an unused destructured build directory.\n- Look up allowed contribution fields through a Set instead of scanning\n  an array on every key.\n- Replace two `/keyframes$/` regex tests with endsWith, and drop an\n  unnecessary escape in the Markdown escaping character class.\n- The routing spec read `contentWindow` off an optional chain and then\n  dereferenced the result, which would have thrown a confusing\n  TypeError if the iframe were ever missing.\n- Build one navigation class name as a single template literal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"78d9e7c4caaa070d15d40958f0b4640bd01645d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/git/trees/78d9e7c4caaa070d15d40958f0b4640bd01645d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/git/commits/c9e296cdb00f79398ce32c453175bc2545ad9db8","verificat