}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio","id":17949154,"login":"yazhouio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTQ5MTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/8cced5b9d9e4c264f0c1ae883f0a8f0bc1edfb22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:37:49Z","email":"git@yazhou.io","name":"ya zhou"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:13:39Z","email":"git@yazhou.io","name":"ya zhou"},"message":"build: add oxlint, oxfmt, editorconfig and git hooks\n\nThe workspace had strong architecture gates (boundaries, Node version,\nplugin contract, routing evidence) but no code-style layer at all: no\nlinter, no formatter, no editor settings and no commit hooks.\n\n- oxlint with the eslint, typescript, unicorn, oxc, import, promise,\n  react, jsx-a11y and vitest plugins; correctness, suspicious and perf\n  are errors. Rules that do not hold for this codebase are disabled with\n  the reason recorded next to them, the most important being the\n  snapshot-before-mutation spreads in the lifecycle code and the\n  Jest-flavoured Vitest assumptions.\n- 34 findings in code that predates the linter stay warnings so the gate\n  is green today; `lint` caps them so the backlog can only shrink.\n- oxfmt keeps oxlint''s defaults and only sets single quotes. Markdown is\n  excluded: the table aligner mangles the CJK docs.\n- lefthook runs both on staged files pre-commit and the full lint\n  pre-push; the slow gates stay in CI.\n- CI runs format:check and lint before typecheck.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f521de9d58bb5b551377a67431264c3120e598e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/git/trees/0f521de9d58bb5b551377a67431264c3120e598e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/git/commits/8cced5b9d9e4c264f0c1ae883f0a8f0bc1edfb22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17949154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio","id":17949154,"login":"yazhouio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTQ5MTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commit/8cced5b9d9e4c264f0c1ae883f0a8f0bc1edfb22","node_id":"C_kwDOUaJ5TtoAKDhjY2VkNWI5ZDllNGMyNjRmMGMxYWU4ODNmMGE4ZjBiYzFlZGZiMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commit/e478c29f89b1056450d9e604308c016d6b38a44d","sha":"e478c29f89b1056450d9e604308c016d6b38a44d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/e478c29f89b1056450d9e604308c016d6b38a44d"}],"sha":"8cced5b9d9e4c264f0c1ae883f0a8f0bc1edfb22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/8cced5b9d9e4c264f0c1ae883f0a8f0bc1edfb22"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17949154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yazhouio","id":17949154,"login":"yazhouio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTQ5MTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yazhouio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yazhouio/nexus-console-service-lab/commits/e478c29f89b1056450d9e604308c016d6b38a44d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:44:26Z","email":"git@yazhou.io","name":"ya zhou"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:13:33Z","email":"git@yazhou.io","name":"ya zhou"},"message":"ci: let packageManager be the only source of the pnpm version\n\npnpm/action-setup@v4 refuses to run when the pnpm version is given both\nin the workflow and in package.json''s packageManager field. CI has been\nfailing on main since 2026-09-14 for this reason, ten seconds in, before\npnpm install — so nothing downstream of it has actually been verified.\n\nThe packageManager field carries a sha512 integrity hash, so it is the\nstricter of the two. Drop the workflow''s plain version number.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"