i-addon-template/commits/ba7d00b7916334cc7f8e286e648fa405b3dd2232/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:54:12Z","email":"pavel.cerny@coworkers.ai","name":"Pavel Černý"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:54:12Z","email":"pavel.cerny@coworkers.ai","name":"Pavel Černý"},"message":"docs: add email_draft example with HtmlAttribute and chips list\n\nNew example module exercising StringListAttribute (chips input) and the\nnew HtmlAttribute (WYSIWYG-edited HTML). Attribute reference documents\nHtmlAttribute, corrects the string_list description, and the type and\nmodule counts are updated throughout.\n\nRequires cw-addons with HtmlAttribute; bump the lower bound in\npyproject.toml once that version is released.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b071d9bc984b83ba85fa8bf11674fb9e112a0b38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daktela/daktela-ai-addon-template/git/trees/b071d9bc984b83ba85fa8bf11674fb9e112a0b38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daktela/daktela-ai-addon-template/git/commits/ba7d00b7916334cc7f8e286e648fa405b3dd2232","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133881130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavel-cw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavel-cw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavel-cw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavel-cw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pavel-cw","id":133881130,"login":"pavel-cw","node_id":"U_kgDOB_rdKg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavel-cw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavel-cw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavel-cw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavel-cw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavel-cw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavel-cw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Daktela/daktela-ai-addon-template/commit/ba7d00b7916334cc7f8e286e648fa405b3dd2232","node_id":"C_kwDOUaQKxtoAKGJhN2QwMGI3OTE2MzM0Y2M3ZjhlMjg2ZTY0OGZhNDA1YjNkZDIyMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Daktela/daktela-ai-addon-template/commit/f05419b86fcb07dc41fff86f4d47b6b8c7b1e6f6","sha":"f05419b86fcb07dc41fff86f4d47b6b8c7b1e6f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daktela/daktela-ai-addon-template/commits/f05419b86fcb07dc41fff86f4d47b6b8c7b1e6f6"}],"sha":"ba7d00b7916334cc7f8e286e648fa405b3dd2232","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daktela/daktela-ai-addon-template/commits/ba7d00b7916334cc7f8e286e648fa405b3dd2232"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/329006772?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cerny-daktela","id":329006772,"login":"cerny-daktela","node_id":"U_kgDOE5w-tA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daktela/daktela-ai-addon-template/commits/f05419b86fcb07dc41fff86f4d47b6b8c7b1e6f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T11:36:10Z","email":"pavel.cerny@daktela.com","name":"Pavel Černý"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T11:36:10Z","email":"pavel.cerny@daktela.com","name":"Pavel Černý"},"message":"Daktela AI addon template\n\nA runnable starter for building addons for the Daktela AI bot platform, plus\nthe developer guide that was missing: fourteen chapters from `git clone` to\n\"I can see my module''s event in the interaction\", six reference pages, and\nworked examples of every capability an addon has.\n\nAn addon is an HTTP service you host. It answers GET /manifest with a\ndescription of what it can do, and the platform calls it while a bot talks to\na customer. This one ships four builder modules, two advanced ones\n(streaming, and a local module the platform runs itself), a function\nintegration, a dynamic list, and a React configuration page mounted into the\nadmin through Module Federation.\n\nThings worth knowing, because they are not obvious from the code:\n\n- Two profiles. ADDON_PROFILE picks `basic` (modules only, no Node in the\n  build) or `full` (plus the configuration page). Most addons want basic.\n  Basic deliberately does not register GET /instance-configured: the platform\n  blocks activation when that route answers 409, and an addon with no\n  configuration page could never clear it. An absent route 404s, which the\n  platform reads as \"nothing to configure\".\n\n- A module''s `version` gates updates. The platform refreshes a module it\n  already knows only when that version changes - edit attributes or ports\n  without bumping it and the sync succeeds, silently, showing the old form.\n\n- Storage is optional. Everything depends on one SettingsStore protocol; the\n  JSON implementation needs nothing, the Postgres one switches on when db_*\n  is set, and the branch that is not selected is never constructed.\n\n- Three dependencies are pinned below latest, each for a reason recorded in\n  CONTRIBUTING.md: MUI by the shared theme''s peer range, TypeScript by\n  typescript-eslint, and Vite because the federation plugin silently emits a\n  broken bundle on 8.\n\nNothing internal ships: no secrets, no Daktela infrastructure, no GitLab CI.\nThe SDK and the shared theme come from registries that are readable\nanonymously, so a third-party developer needs no Daktela account to build\nagainst them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a64b832e541bfd81150846238bb112fdd26956b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daktela/daktela-ai-addon-template/git/trees/a64b832e541bfd81150846238bb112fdd26956b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daktela/daktela-ai-addon-template/git/commits/f05419b86fcb07dc41fff86f4d47b6b8c7b1e6f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/329006772?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cerny-daktela","id":329006772,"login":"cerny-daktela","node_id":"U_kgDOE5w-tA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cerny-daktela","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Daktela/daktela-ai-addon-template/commit/f05419b86fcb07dc41fff86f4d47b6b8c7b1e6f6","node_id":"C_kwDOUaQKxtoAKGYwNTQxOWI4NmZjYjA3ZGM0MWZmZjg2ZjRkNDdiNmI4YzdiMWU2ZjY","parents":[],"sha":"f05419b86fcb07dc41fff86f4d47b6b8c7b1e6f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daktela/daktela-ai-addon-template/commits/f05419b86fcb07dc41fff86f4d47b6b8c7b1e6f6"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daktela/daktela-ai-addon-template/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=804bc32ac81cecc8be2847f13f7c8311fb5b8dc8&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A42%3A05.147Z"}');
